 `openssl req -in request.csr -noout -verify -text`. Check signature, subject and SAN before sending it. A CSR does not determine the final certificate by itself: issuance policy can replace its fields."},"2312":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/key-management-119","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/key-management#sign-locally-with-pkcs11","content":"Lamassu also offers specific help for local integrations through **Sign locally with OpenSSL & PKCS11 tools**."},"2313":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/key-management-120","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/key-management#sign-locally-with-pkcs11","content":"Requiere el módulo, token y permisos del proveedor correspondiente. Comprueba que el identificador de Lamassu se corresponde con el objeto accesible desde ese módulo. La configuración del módulo pertenece al entorno del cliente o al Despliegue."},"2314":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/key-management-121","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/key-management","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/key-management#before-deleting-a-key","content":"Review **Related Entities** and locate CAs, certificates and validation processes that still need signatures. Revoking a CA does not remove the need to publish status during its retention period. Deleting a key does not automatically revoke its certificates either. Plan replacement and retention before using **Delete Key**; provider deletion behavior depends on the engine."},"2315":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/ocsp","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/ocsp","type":"page","content":"Online validation with OCSP","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Platform","PKI","Validation"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/ocsp"},"2316":{"id":"/docs/pr-previ