te-certificate-authority#select-the-key-toc","content":"The CA private key is used through the engine. In this path, you will download only the authority's public certificate."},"2414":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-the-authority-toc","content":"Select **Root CA** and complete:"},"2415":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-the-authority-toc","content":"**CA Name**: `Acme Evaluation Root CA`."},"2416":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-the-authority-toc","content":"**Subject**: organization and country details for your evaluation."},"2417":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-the-authority-toc","content":"**CA Certificate Expiration**: for example, one year from creation."},"2418":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-the-authority-toc","content":"**Default End-Entity Certificate Issuance Expiration**: for example, 90 days, within the CA's lifetime."},"2419":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-the-authority-toc","content":"The CA name becomes its `Common Name`. Keep the CA usages needed to sign certificates and CRLs."},"2420":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#review-and-create-the-ca-toc","content":"Check the engine, algorithm, subject, root type and dates. Confirm creation and note the authority identifier so you can recognize it in the DMS or API."},"2421":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#verify-the-result-toc","content":"Open the new CA. It should appear active, show its certificate and allow access to **Issued Certificates**."},"2422":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#verify-the-result-toc","content":"Download or copy the authority's PEM certificate and save it as `ca.pem`. Check that the file contains the complete block, including `BEGIN CERTIFICATE` and `END CERTIFICATE`."},