/pr-56/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-106","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#ship-the-next-version","content":"A built pack version is immutable. To change it, create the next version, upload what changed and build again:"},"3574":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-107","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#ship-the-next-version","content":"The version must be strictly higher than the current one. The new version starts unbuilt and carries the current artifacts forward."},"3575":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-108","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#ship-the-next-version","content":"To update one device to an exact version without a campaign, use `POST $API/devices/<device-id>/force-version` with `{\"distribution_set_id\":\"<pack id>\",\"version\":\"1.1.0\"}`; in native mode it creates a one-device launch and defaults to the `phased` workflow for SWU packs (`download-install` for `non-swu`) unless you pass a `workflow`."},"3576":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-109","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#hawkbit-mode","content":"hawkBit packs are assembled from built catalog modules, so the pack-side steps 2 and 3 move to the catalog:"},"3577":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-110","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#hawkbit-mode","content":"Create the module: `POST $API/softwaremodules` with `type` (`os` or `application`), `name`, `version` and a `delivery_intent`: `swu-build`, `swu-prebuilt` or `raw`. `undecided` is accepted, but a module cannot join a pack until you choose."},"3578":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-111","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#hawkbit-mode","content":"Upload the file with `POST $API/softwaremodules/by-id/<id>/artifacts`. For `swu-build`, also upload the `sw-description` to `.../descriptor` and call `POST $API/softwaremodules/by-id/<id>/build`. For `swu-prebuilt`, uploading the `.swu` is the build. For `raw`, call `.../build` to make the files the deliverable; signing and encryption are optional."},"3579":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-112","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#hawkbit-mode","content":"Create the pack with `\"modules\":[{\"source_module_id\":\"<id>\"}]`. It is created already built."},"3580":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-113","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#hawkbit-mode","content":"Then continue at step 4. Details, including the delivery intents, are in hawkBit mode, and a full request sequence is in hawkBit curl guide."},"3581":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-114","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/upd