n. See Signing and encryption"},"4268":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/api-257","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/api#request-bodies","content":"Artifacts reach a build only through `selected_artifact_ids`; without them there is normally nothing staged and the build fails. A build replaces the pack's carried artifact links with the selected ones."},"4269":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/api-258","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/api#responses","content":"Create routes answer `201` with the object: a pack, a module, or for a launch the launch ID and the precondition outcome. `modules` is an input of pack creation and is not returned on reads."},"4270":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/api-259","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/api#responses","content":"`DELETE` of a pack answers `200` with `{\"message\": \"...\"}`. `POST .../new`, `.../swu` and `.../package` answer `200` with `{\"message\": \"...\"}`."},"4271":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/api-260","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/api#responses","content":"Artifact uploads answer `{\"msg\": \"...\", \"artifact\": {...}}`: `201` for `POST /artifacts`, `200` for the pack-scoped and module-scoped uploads."},"4272":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/api-261","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/api#responses","content":"Descriptor uploads on a pack 