se all history. Deferred revocation can fail after retirement is saved; check the result by serial."],[2657,"The background work (the WFX event consumer and the scheduled-launch trigger) runs on exactly one replica at a time. Leader election picks it: Kubernetes Leases when running inside a cluster, a Postgres advisory lock elsewhere, configurable with `leader_election.mode` (`\"\"`, `kubernetes` or `database`). Without election every replica would count the same job completions and release batches early, so a failure to configure it stops the service at start-up. Batch dispatch is also protected by a per-launch lock, so two callers never send the same batch twice."],[3483,"The binary to deliver and, for an SWU pack, a `sw-description` file."],[900,"The blocks are independent:"],[3517,"The body above builds an unencrypted, unsigned `.swu`. To sign or encrypt, add fields as described in Signing and encryption."],[1038,"The body is **MIME multipart/mixed**, with the boundary specified in `Content-Type`. It contains two parts:"],[4047,"The body is `{\"err\":\"<message>\"}`"],[5207,"The build body decides the mode:"],[2990,"The build context (the parent of `ota/`) does not contain `lamassuiot/`"],[5310,"The build context is not the parent of the checkout"],[3448,"The build fails with an empty binaries directory"],[3449,"The build received no `selected_artifact_ids`"],[5174,"The build request, plus a key in SymKMS"],[2077,"The CA hierarchy defines which authorities can sign. A root CA establishes the anchor of trust; intermediate CAs separate operating domains and avoid using the root for every issuance."],[5680,"The CA migration adds a UNIQUE constraint on `ca_certificates.id` and aborts if duplicate CA IDs exist. Imports already reject duplicates with `409`, so new ones cannot normally appear."],[1472,"The CA must be registered in AWS in Primary Account mode (SNI-only mode does not support JITP)."],[2419,"The CA name becomes its `Common Name`. Keep the CA usages needed