elf-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"genera `lamassu.yaml` e instala el chart de Lamassu"},"190":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-112","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"carga datos de ejemplo opcionalmente"},"191":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-113","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"La configuración generada expone Keycloak en `/auth` a través del mismo Gateway y provisiona al usuario inicial `lamassu` como superadministrador de Lamassu."},"192":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-114","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#comportamiento-tls","content":"Al proporcionar `--tls-crt` y `--tls-key`, Fastlane crea el Secret `downstream-provided-crt` y configura `tls.type: external`."},"193":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-115","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#comportamiento-tls","content":"Sin ellos, configura cert-manager con un emisor self-signed. Es adecuado para laboratorio, pero los clientes no confiarán en él hasta que distribuyas la CA. Usa Helm si necesitas un Issuer corporativo, un emisor ACME público o un Secret existente gestionado por otro sistema."},"194":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-116","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#credenciales-y-archivos-generados","content":"El modo no interactivo genera contraseñas aleatorias para los administradores de PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ y Keycloak. El acceso inicial a Lamassu es `lamassu` / `lamassu` y obliga a cambiar la contraseña en el primer uso, salvo que se haya usado `--development`: en ese caso la contraseña permanece fija y permanente."},"195":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-117","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#credenciales-y-archivos-generados","content":"Fastlane escribe `lamassu.yaml` en el directorio actual e incluye credenciales en él."},"196":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-118","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#credenciales-y-archivos-generados","content":"Protege el archivo de valores generado, guarda las credenciales en un almacén de secretos apropiado y no reutilices la configuración de identidad de evaluación en producción."},"197":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-119","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#verifica-la-instalación","content":"Abre `https://pki.example.com` e inicia sesión con el usuario inicial. Si el Gateway está programado pero la URL no es accesible, sigue las comprobaciones de Expón el Gateway."},"198":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","type":"page","content":"Instala con Helm","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Despliegue","Kubernetes autogestionado"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm"},"199":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","content":"Prepara las dependencias, configura el chart de Lamassu y verifica un despliegue controlado en Kubernetes."},"200":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#instala-lamassu-con-helm","content":"Instala Lamassu con Helm"},"201":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"Antes de comenzar"},"202":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#1-instala-los-requisitos-del-gateway","content":"1\\. Instala los requisitos del Gateway"},"203":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#2-crea-un-archivo-de-valores","content":"2\\. Crea un archivo de valores"},"204":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#tls-con-un-secret-existente","content":"TLS con un Secret existente"},"205":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#tls-de-amqp-amqps","content":"TLS de AMQP (AMQPS)"},"206":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"Provisiona el primer administrador"},"207":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#3-instala-lamassu","content":"3\\. Instala Lamassu"},"208":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#4-verifica-el-despliegue","content":"4\\. Verifica el despliegue"},"209":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"Decisiones para producción"},"210":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#instala-lamassu-con-helm","content":"Usa Helm cuando necesites control explícito sobre identidad, bases de datos, mensajería, certificados, almacenamiento y upgrades. Para un entorno de evaluación en el que el script pueda tomar esas decisiones, usa Fastlane."},"211":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"Prepara los servicios de plataforma que quedan deliberadamente fuera del chart de Lamassu:"},"212":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"un clúster Kubernetes 1.24+ y Helm 3.2+"},"213":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"un servidor PostgreSQL accesible y un rol autorizado para crear bases de datos y schemas"},"214":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"un broker RabbitMQ accesible y sus credenciales"},"215":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"un proveedor OIDC, normalmente Keycloak, con un realm/tenant y un cliente para Lamassu"},"216":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"Envoy Gateway 1.8+ y una `GatewayClass`"},"217":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"cert-manager 1.14+ (solo para el modo predeterminado `tls.type: certManager`); para TLS de confianza, un emisor de confianza o un Secret TLS de Kubernetes"},"218":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"una StorageClass y un diseño de tráfico externo"},"219":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"El chart usa por defecto una `GatewayClass` llamada `eg`. Cambia `gateway.className` si tu equipo de plataforma utiliza otro nombre."},"220":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"Tú proporcionas el servidor PostgreSQL. El job de pre-install del chart se conecta con las credenciales indicadas, crea las bases de datos `pki`, `authz` y `wfx` y los schemas de los servicios, ejecuta las migraciones y aplica `services.authz.bootstrap`."},"221":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#antes-de-comenzar","content":"El chart no tiene dependencias Helm que instalen PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ, un proveedor OIDC, Envoy Gateway ni cert-manager."},"222":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#1-instala-los-requisitos-del-gateway","content":"Instala o actualiza las CRD de Envoy Gateway antes de su controlador. Estos comandos usan la misma versión que el repositorio Helm de Lamassu:"},"223":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#1-instala-los-requisitos-del-gateway","content":"Crea la `GatewayClass` predeterminada si todavía no existe. Guarda este manifiesto como `gateway-class.yaml`:"},"224":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#1-instala-los-requisitos-del-gateway","content":"Instala cert-manager por separado antes de Lamassu, pero solo para el modo predeterminado `tls.type: certManager`. En ese modo el chart renderiza sus recursos de Issuer self-signed y Certificate CA tanto si `tls.certManagerOptions.clusterIssuer` está definido como si no, por lo que cert-manager sigue siendo un requisito. Con `tls.type: external`, el chart no renderiza recursos de cert-manager y el Gateway termina el TLS con un Secret existente que tú proporcionas."},"225":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#2-crea-un-archivo-de-valores","content":"Parte de los valores predeterminados del chart y sobrescribe los específicos del entorno. Este ejemplo supone que PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ y Keycloak son accesibles mediante DNS de Kubernetes y expone Keycloak en `/auth` a través del Gateway compartido:"},"226":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#2-crea-un-archivo-de-valores","content":"No añadas `gateway.addresses` por defecto. Deja la asignación de dirección a la implementación del balanceador salvo que tu diseño de red requiera una VIP concreta en Kubernetes. La IP pública de un NAT o proxy upstream no corresponde a este valor."},"227":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#2-crea-un-archivo-de-valores","content":"Si Keycloak es externo y ya tiene una URL accesible, apunta la configuración OIDC hacia él y omite la entrada `/auth` de `gateway.extraRouting`."},"228":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#2-crea-un-archivo-de-valores","content":"Si tu archivo de valores aún contiene los ajustes heredados de validación JWT del Gateway — `auth.oidc.apiGateway.jwks`, `auth.authorization.rolesClaim` o `auth.authorization.roles.admin` — elimínalos. La guía de migración `charts/lamassu/CHANGELOG/3.8.0->4.0.0.md` documenta su eliminación sin alias de compatibilidad, y `values.schema.json` rechaza los bloques residuales en lugar de ignorarlos silenciosamente. Los reemplazos son `services.authz.jwkUrl` y `services.authz.bootstrap`, que ya aparecen en el ejemplo anterior."},"229":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#tls-con-un-secret-existente","content":"Crea un Secret con `tls.crt` y `tls.key` y referéncialo. El Secret debe existir antes de instalar: en modo `external` el chart no renderiza recursos de cert-manager ni crea nunca este Secret."},"230":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#tls-de-amqp-amqps","content":"`amqp.tls: true` selecciona AMQPS en todos los bloques de configuración del bus de eventos. El puerto por defecto sigue siendo `5672` y no cambia automáticamente al habilitar TLS, así que define `amqp.port` con el listener TLS del broker, normalmente `5671`."},"231":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#tls-de-amqp-amqps","content":"Sin un Secret de CA configurado, los clientes del bus de eventos usan las CA de confianza del sistema. Para confiar en una CA privada, crea un Secret en el namespace del release con el certificado de la CA en formato PEM y define `amqp.ca.secretName` (y `amqp.ca.certificateKey` si la clave de datos no es `ca.crt`)."},"232":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#tls-de-amqp-amqps","content":"Para brokers que exijan TLS mutuo, crea un Secret con el certificado de cliente y su clave privada y define `amqp.client.secretName` (con `amqp.client.certificateKey` y `amqp.client.privateKeyKey` si las claves de datos no son `tls.crt` y `tls.key`)."},"233":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#tls-de-amqp-amqps","content":"El chart monta los Secrets configurados en modo de solo lectura en todas las cargas de trabajo que consumen AMQP: el certificado de la CA en `/etc/lamassu/amqp/ca` y el certificado y la clave de cliente en `/etc/lamassu/amqp/client`. Los nombres de los archivos montados son siempre `ca.crt`, `tls.crt` y `tls.key` — los valores `certificateKey` y `privateKeyKey` renombran solo las claves de datos del Secret, nunca las rutas en disco. La clave privada del cliente se monta con permisos restrictivos (`defaultMode: 0440`; el volumen de la CA usa `0444`), que funcionan porque el chart añade `fsGroup` al security context del pod cuando `amqp.client.secretName` está definido — usa el `runAsGroup` del contenedor (por defecto `65532`) cuando `fsGroup` no está ya definido."},"234":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#tls-de-amqp-amqps","content":"Ambas opciones de Secret exigen `amqp.tls: true`: `values.schema.json` rechaza un `secretName` no vacío cuando `tls` es false, rechaza claves desconocidas y rechaza nombres de clave de datos fuera de `^[A-Za-z0-9._-]+$`. El Secret referenciado debe existir en el namespace del release o los pods consumidores no llegan a arrancar."},"235":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#tls-de-amqp-amqps","content":"El cliente AMQP carga los certificados al arrancar, así que reinicia los pods consumidores tras actualizar cualquiera de los dos Secrets. Cambiar cualquier valor de `amqp` reinicia las cargas de trabajo consumidoras mediante la anotación `checksum/config`, pero cambiar solo el contenido de un Secret no desencadena un rollout."},"236":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#tls-de-amqp-amqps","content":"Según la guía de migración `charts/lamassu/CHANGELOG/3.8.0->4.0.0.md`: en 3.8.0 `amqp.tls` no se aplicaba y los clientes del bus de eventos usaban AMQP en claro; desde 4.0.0, `amqp.tls: true` los cambia a AMQPS. Define `amqp.port` con el listener TLS del broker antes del upgrade, o usa `amqp.tls: false` para mantener AMQP en claro. `amqp.tls: false` envía las credenciales del broker y todo el tráfico del bus de eventos en claro."},"237":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"No existe un superusuario implícito. Crea en el proveedor OIDC el rol o grupo esperado por `services.authz.bootstrap` y asígnalo al menos a un administrador antes de exponer Lamassu."},"238":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"El job de pre-install y pre-upgrade aplica el bootstrap de forma idempotente: conserva los principales existentes y añade los grants que falten."},"239":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-40","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"Prueba una identidad autorizada y otra denegada. Si ningún token coincide con un principal activo del bootstrap, nadie podrá administrar la PKI."},"240":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-41","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#provisiona-el-primer-administrador","content":"Consulta Control de acceso para conocer el modelo de principales y políticas."},"241":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-42","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#3-instala-lamassu","content":"Para instalar un checkout local:"},"242":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-43","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#4-verifica-el-despliegue","content":"El Gateway debe mostrar `PROGRAMMED=True`. Si está programado pero no tiene una dirección utilizable, continúa con Expón el Gateway."},"243":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-44","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#4-verifica-el-despliegue","content":"El test de Helm comprueba los endpoints de salud de CA, DMS Manager, Device Manager y VA, y verifica la respuesta de la UI."},"244":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-45","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"Antes de pasar a producción, revisa:"},"245":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-46","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"backup y recuperación de PostgreSQL y volúmenes persistentes"},"246":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-47","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"un motor KMS de producción; el motor filesystem predeterminado no ofrece alta disponibilidad"},"247":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-48","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"almacenamiento compartido para VA antes de aumentar sus réplicas"},"248":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-49","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"roles OIDC gestionados y eliminación de credenciales de evaluación"},"249":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-50","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"un emisor TLS de confianza o un certificado gestionado externamente"},"250":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-51","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"recursos, réplicas, autoscaling, disruption budgets y placement"},"251":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-52","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"SMTP, observabilidad y entrega de alertas"},"252":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-53","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"las guías de actualización entre versiones y las notas de `charts/lamassu/CHANGELOG/` antes de cada upgrade"},"253":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm-54","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm#decisiones-para-producción","content":"La referencia completa de valores se mantiene en `charts/lamassu/VALUES.md` dentro del repositorio Helm."},"254":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"page","content":"Expón el Gateway","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Despliegue","Kubernetes autogestionado"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking"},"255":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","content":"Elige cómo llegan los clientes a Lamassu, cuándo definir gateway.addresses y cómo diseñar varios Gateways."},"256":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#expón-el-gateway-de-lamassu","content":"Expón el Gateway de Lamassu"},"257":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"¿Necesitas `gateway.addresses`?"},"258":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#diseño-recomendado-para-un-solo-nodo","content":"Diseño recomendado para un solo nodo"},"259":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#k3s","content":"K3s"},"260":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#bare-metal-con-metallb-o-kube-vip","content":"Bare metal con MetalLB o kube-vip"},"261":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#proxy-externo-nat-o-vpn","content":"Proxy externo, NAT o VPN"},"262":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"¿Qué ocurre si necesitas tres Gateways?"},"263":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#guía-de-decisión","content":"Guía de decisión"},"264":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#proxy-de-salida","content":"Proxy de salida"},"265":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#verifica-la-ruta-de-tráfico","content":"Verifica la ruta de tráfico"},"266":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#expón-el-gateway-de-lamassu","content":"El chart de Lamassu crea un Gateway compartido con listeners HTTP y HTTPS. Envoy Gateway crea normalmente un deployment de proxy dedicado y un Service `LoadBalancer`."},"267":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#expón-el-gateway-de-lamassu","content":"La accesibilidad externa depende de toda la ruta. Un recurso `Gateway` no configura por sí mismo el router, firewall, DNS, balanceador cloud ni NAT upstream."},"268":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"Normalmente no. Si lo omites, el controlador del Gateway y la implementación del balanceador pueden asignar una dirección y publicarla en `Gateway.status.addresses` y en el estado del Service generado."},"269":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"Defínelo únicamente cuando:"},"270":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"tu balanceador cloud o bare metal permite solicitar una dirección concreta"},"271":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"esa dirección está asignada a este Gateway"},"272":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"la red ya enruta el tráfico de esa dirección hasta el clúster"},"273":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"Esto solicita `192.168.1.50`; no reclama la IP en tu LAN ni la vuelve accesible."},"274":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"No confundas estos valores:"},"275":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"`gateway.addresses` solicita una dirección para el Gateway."},"276":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"`tls.certManagerOptions.certSpec.addresses` añade direcciones IP a los SAN del certificado TLS."},"277":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#necesitas-gatewayaddresses","content":"Si los usuarios se conectan por DNS, añade el nombre a `tls.certManagerOptions.certSpec.hostnames`. No copies la IP pública de un proxy upstream en `gateway.addresses`."},"278":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#diseño-recomendado-para-un-solo-nodo","content":"Para una VM pequeña con K3s o MicroK8s, usa un único Gateway externo de Lamassu y enruta todos los endpoints a través de él:"},"279":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#diseño-recomendado-para-un-solo-nodo","content":"Este diseño utiliza una IP, un punto de entrada TLS y un único par de puertos. El chart ya crea las rutas necesarias."},"280":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#k3s","content":"K3s ServiceLB implementa cada Service `LoadBalancer` mediante pods que reservan los puertos del Service en el nodo. En un único nodo, solo un Service puede ocupar el puerto 80 y otro el 443. El Service Traefik que K3s instala por defecto puede estar ocupando ambos."},"281":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#k3s","content":"Para el diseño recomendado:"},"282":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#k3s","content":"Usa un único Gateway de Lamassu expuesto externamente."},"283":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#k3s","content":"Comprueba que los puertos 80 y 443 están libres. Deshabilita o reconfigura Traefik si no forma parte de la ruta de tráfico."},"284":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#k3s","content":"Permite esos puertos en el firewall de la VM y en cualquier security group upstream."},"285":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#k3s","content":"Apunta DNS a la dirección accesible de la VM."},"286":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#k3s","content":"Consulta la documentación de K3s ServiceLB para conocer el uso de host ports y cómo sustituirlo por