de re-enrollment."},"1609":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configura-el-dms-de-evaluación","content":"Re-enrollment Validation CAs / Enable Expired Renewal"},"1610":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configura-el-dms-de-evaluación","content":"No se necesitan para esta emisión directa; la CA de enrolamiento siempre es confiable en el reenrolamiento / deshabilitado."},"1611":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configura-el-dms-de-evaluación","content":"Re-enrollment Delta"},"1612":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configura-el-dms-de-evaluación","content":"1 hora."},"1613":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configura-el-dms-de-evaluación","content":"Preventive / Critical Delta"},"1614":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-40","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configura-el-dms-de-evaluación","content":"30 minutos / 10 minutos."},"1615":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-41","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configura-el-dms-de-evaluación","content":"Revoke on Re-enrollment"},"1616":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-42","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configura-el-dms-de-evaluación","content":"Deshabilitado para probar el sucesor antes de retirar el anterior."},"1617":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-43","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configura-el-dms-de-evaluación","content":"ServerKeyGen"},"1618":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-44","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configura-el-dms-de-evaluación","content":"Deshabilitado; la clave operativa se genera en el cliente."},"1619":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-45","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configura-el-dms-de-evaluación","content":"CA Distribution"},"1620":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-46","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configura-el-dms-de-evaluación","content":"Include Enrollment CA habilitado; Include Lamassu System CA deshabilitado."},"1621":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-47","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#configura-el-dms-de-evaluación","content":"La duración y ventana iguales permiten probar renovación inmediatamente. Son valores de evaluación; dimensiona producción según conectividad y tiempos de recuperación. Guarda, vuelve a leer los dos bloques de autenticación y conserva el ID del DMS. La consola expone editores independientes para la autenticación de enrolamiento y de reenrolamiento; la guía DMS describe sus campos, y también puedes comprobar el recurso mediante la API DMS."},"1622":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-48","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#prepara-el-cliente-y-comprueba-cacerts","content":"En el directorio nuevo, coloca los cuatro archivos de confianza y bootstrap. Sustituye el URL por el de tu instalación:"},"1623":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-49","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#prepara-el-cliente-y-comprueba-cacerts","content":"La descarga debe ser satisfactoria y contener la raíz de enrolamiento prevista. Compara su huella con `device-root.pem`. Esta comprobación no convierte la respuesta en confianza inicial ni demuestra que puedas emitir."},"1624":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-50","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#enrola-el-dispositivo","content":"Genera una clave nueva y una CSR con el identificador elegido:"},"1625":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-51","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#enrola-el-dispositivo","content":"Solicita la identidad con la credencial inicial y extrae el certificado de la respuesta predeterminada:"},"1626":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-52","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#enrola-el-dispositivo","content":"Si curl falla, consulta Diagnóstico con el cuerpo guardado. No ejecutes la conversión ni repitas la solicitud sin consultar el inventario: un timeout o error puede seguir a una emisión persistida."},"1627":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-53","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#verifica-la-identidad-obtenida","content":"Espera `device.crt: OK` y código 0 de `cmp`. Comprueba CN, serie, fechas, Digital Signature y Client Authentication. El certificado debe ser final: no declarar `CA:TRUE` ni uso Certificate Sign. Revisa que su validez corresponda al perfil de una hora."},"1628":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-54","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#verifica-la-identidad-obtenida","content":"En Lamassu, abre `est-device-001`. Debe estar creado con el DMS propietario previsto, una identidad actual y el certificado recibido en su historial. Compara la serie local con la del slot; los umbrales pueden mostrar un estado de renovación en vez de un simple Active."},"1629":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-55","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#demuestra-una-conexión-mtls","content":"En una segunda terminal, entra en el mismo directorio y ejecuta `umask 077`. Crea un certificado local de servidor y arranca un consumidor de prueba. Este servidor confía en `device-root.pem` y exige una identidad cliente válida:"},"1630":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-56","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#demuestra-una-conexión-mtls","content":"Déjalo funcionando. En la primera terminal, realiza la conexión con la identidad obtenida:"},"1631":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-57","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#demuestra-una-conexión-mtls","content":"Espera HTTP `200`. La confianza del cliente en este servidor local es su certificado autofirmado `consumer.crt`; el servidor verifica al dispositivo contra `device-root.pem`. El archivo HTML muestra información de diagnóstico de OpenSSL."},"1632":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-58","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#demuestra-una-conexión-mtls","content":"Con el mismo servidor todavía funcionando, prueba que una solicitud sin certificado cliente se rechaza:"},"1633":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-59","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#demuestra-una-conexión-mtls","content":"El rechazo debe corresponder a la falta de certificado en el servidor, no a un servidor detenido. Termina el consumidor con Ctrl+C después de la prueba. Este ejercicio demuestra autenticación TLS y posesión de la clave; tu aplicación debe definir además autorización y consumo de revocación. Las opciones del servidor se describen en openssl-s\\_server."},"1634":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-60","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#resultado-y-continuidad","content":"Comprobación"},"1635":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-61","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#resultado-y-continuidad","content":"Resultado esperado"},"1636":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-62","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#resultado-y-continuidad","content":"Registro"},"1637":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-63","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#resultado-y-continuidad","content":"ID creado automáticamente y DMS correcto."},"1638":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-64","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#resultado-y-continuidad","content":"Certificado"},"1639":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-65","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#resultado-y-continuidad","content":"CN, perfil, serie y clave verificados."},"1640":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-66","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#resultado-y-continuidad","content":"Inventario"},"1641":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-67","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#resultado-y-continuidad","content":"Serie recibida visible como identidad actual y en el historial."},"1642":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-68","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#resultado-y-continuidad","content":"Consumidor"},"1643":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-69","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#resultado-y-continuidad","content":"mTLS responde 200 con la identidad y rechaza falta de certificado."},"1644":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-70","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#resultado-y-continuidad","content":"Continúa con Renovación y recuperación para solicitar una pareja sucesora dentro de la ventana, instalarla y repetir la comprobación mTLS. El consumidor debe utilizar los archivos nuevos en esa prueba. Después de comprobar el sucesor, retira el certificado anterior según la política PKI; el ejemplo no lo revoca automáticamente."},"1645":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-71","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#resultado-y-continuidad","content":"Dispositivos e identidades explica la retirada y los límites de revocación del historial. Para un destino real, prepara confianza, validación y permisos del consumidor; AWS IoT Core es una integración disponible."},"1646":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","type":"page","content":"Registra un dispositivo manualmente","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","IoT Fleets","Primeros pasos"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device"},"1647":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","content":"Prepara un DMS, registra un dispositivo y asocia un certificado comprobado a su identidad."},"1648":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#antes-de-empezar","content":"Antes de empezar"},"1649":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"Prepara el DMS"},"1650":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#registra-el-dispositivo","content":"Registra el dispositivo"},"1651":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#comprueba-el-estado-inicial","content":"Comprueba el estado inicial"},"1652":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#asigna-una-identidad","content":"Asigna una identidad"},"1653":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#verifica-el-dispositivo","content":"Verifica el dispositivo"},"1654":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#resultado-esperado","content":"Resultado esperado"},"1655":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Si el resultado falla"},"1656":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#automatiza-el-siguiente-dispositivo","content":"Automatiza el siguiente dispositivo"},"1657":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","content":"Este recorrido está dirigido a quien empieza a administrar identidades de dispositivos. Registrarás `device-001` y le asignarás un certificado existente para comprobar la relación entre dispositivo, DMS e historial de identidad."},"1658":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","content":"La asignación modifica el inventario de Lamassu. La clave y el certificado se instalan por separado en el dispositivo; la conexión con un consumidor se comprueba en la integración de ese destino."},"1659":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#antes-de-empezar","content":"Una instancia accesible y permisos para administrar DMS, dispositivos y la asociación de certificados."},"1660":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#antes-de-empezar","content":"Una CA activa con clave disponible. Si todavía no existe, sigue Crea tu primera CA."},"1661":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#antes-de-empezar","content":"Un certificado final activo de esa CA cuyo `Common Name` sea exactamente `device-001`, con su clave privada. Sigue Emite y verifica un certificado para obtener y comprobar ambos."},"1662":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#antes-de-empezar","content":"El identificador `device-001` libre en el inventario. Si ya lo usaste, elige otro y emite el certificado con ese mismo `Common Name`."},"1663":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"Un DMS debe existir antes de registrar el dispositivo. Si ya tienes uno adecuado, comprueba su CA y anota su identificador; si necesitas crearlo:"},"1664":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"Abre el inventario de DMS y la acción de creación. Asigna un nombre reconocible, como `Acme Evaluation DMS`."},"1665":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"En **Enrollment CA**, selecciona la CA que emitió `device.crt`."},"1666":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"En **Registration Mode**, selecciona `PRE_REGISTRATION` para el recorrido que comienza con un alta explícita."},"1667":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"En la sección de autenticación, activa **Require client certificate** y deja **Call external webhook** desactivado. Bajo **Require client certificate**, añade a **Validation CAs** la CA cuyos certificados iniciales aceptarás; para esta evaluación puede ser la misma CA. Mantén habilitada **Verify CSR Signature** y deja **Enable server-side key generation** desactivado si no lo vas a utilizar."},"1668":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"Revisa los ajustes de renovación y distribución de confianza con la guía DMS, guarda el servicio y anota su identificador."},"1669":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"Vuelve a abrir el DMS y confirma que la CA de enrolamiento es la prevista y que el servicio aparece en el inventario."},"1670":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"Estos ajustes preparan la política DMS. Los pasos siguientes realizan el alta y la asignación desde la consola; no envían una solicitud EST ni prueban la admisión por ese protocolo."},"1671":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#registra-el-dispositivo","content":"Abre **Managed Devices** y la acción de registro. Completa:"},"1672":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#registra-el-dispositivo","content":"**Device ID**: `device-001`."},"1673":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#registra-el-dispositivo","content":"**Registration Authority**: el DMS que acabas de preparar; la etiqueta identifica al servicio que cumple el rol de autoridad de registro."},"1674":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#registra-el-dispositivo","content":"**Icon** y **Tags**: clasificación opcional."},"1675":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"t