tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview#elige-tu-recorrido","content":"**PKI**"},"1721":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview#elige-tu-recorrido","content":"Claves, autoridades, perfiles, certificados y publicación del estado de revocación."},"1722":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview#elige-tu-recorrido","content":"Visión general de PKI"},"1723":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview#elige-tu-recorrido","content":"**IoT Fleets**"},"1724":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview#elige-tu-recorrido","content":"Dispositivos, historial de identidad, políticas DMS, enrolamiento EST e integraciones."},"1725":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview#elige-tu-recorrido","content":"Visión general de IoT Fleets"},"1726":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview#elige-tu-recorrido","content":"**Administración**"},"1727":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview#elige-tu-recorrido","content":"Permisos de operadores, auditoría y suscripciones a eventos."},"1728":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview#elige-tu-recorrido","content":"Control de acceso"},"1729":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview#elige-tu-recorrido","content":"Una CA determina quién firma y un perfil establece qué puede emitirse. El DMS aplica la política de admisión y enrolamiento. El dispositivo conserva la asociación con sus certificados, y el consumidor externo decide qué identidad acepta."},"1730":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview#arquitectura-de-un-vistazo","content":"El recorrido de una identidad conecta cuatro responsabilidades:"},"1731":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview#arquitectura-de-un-vistazo","content":"El administrador PKI prepara la autoridad, su clave y las reglas de emisión."},"1732":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview#arquitectura-de-un-vistazo","content":"El administrador del aprovisionamiento configura el DMS y la confianza inicial."},"1733":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview#arquitectura-de-un-vistazo","content":"El cliente del dispositivo solicita un certificado y lo instala junto con la clave que le corresponde."},"1734":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview#arquitectura-de-un-vistazo","content":"El consumidor valida la identidad y aplica sus permisos de acceso."},"1735":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview#arquitectura-de-un-vistazo","content":"Consulta Cómo funciona Lamassu para entender los recursos y la arquitectura de la plataforma para conocer los servicios. La instalación, la exposición de red y las dependencias se explican en Despliegue."},"1736":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview#construye-tu-jerarquía-de-confianza","content":"Crea o incorpora autoridades y organiza sus relaciones en PKI. La jerarquía y su rotación determinan qué cadenas deberán reconocer los consumidores."},"1737":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview#protege-las-claves-criptográficas","content":"Elige el motor que custodiará las claves de las autoridades y controla quién puede utilizarlas. Consulta Claves y motores; la preparación del proveedor forma parte del despliegue."},"1738":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview#emite-y-controla-certificados","content":"Define perfiles de emisión, firma solicitudes y consulta el inventario de certificados. El certificado emitido debe comprobarse desde el cliente que lo utilizará."},"1739":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview#automatiza-identidades-de-dispositivos","content":"Configura un DMS y utiliza EST para solicitar y renovar certificados. La preparación de la credencial inicial y la instalación del resultado pertenecen a la integración del dispositivo."},"1740":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview-40","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview#publica-el-estado-de-validación","content":"Utiliza OCSP y CRL para publicar el estado de revocación. Cada consumidor debe configurar cómo consulta y aplica esa información."},"1741":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview-41","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview#reacciona-a-los-eventos","content":"Consulta auditoría para investigar cambios y configura alertas y suscripciones para reaccionar a eventos del ciclo de vida."},"1742":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview-42","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview#referencia-operativa","content":"Responsabilidad"},"1743":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview-43","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview#referencia-operativa","content":"Qué prepara o comprueba"},"1744":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview-44","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview#referencia-operativa","content":"Administrador PKI"},"1745":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview-45","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview#referencia-operativa","content":"Custodia de claves, jerarquía de CAs, perfiles y validación."},"1746":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview-46","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview#referencia-operativa","content":"Administrador de la flota"},"1747":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview-47","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview#referencia-operativa","content":"DMS, admisión de dispositivos, política de renovación e inventario."},"1748":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview-48","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview#referencia-operativa","content":"Integrador del dispositivo"},"1749":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview-49","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview#referencia-operativa","content":"Credencial inicial, confianza en el servidor, cliente EST y almacenamiento de clave y certificado."},"1750":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview-50","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview#referencia-operativa","content":"Integrador del consumidor"},"1751":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview-51","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview#referencia-operativa","content":"Confianza en los emisores, validación de certificados y permisos en el destino."},"1752":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview-52","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview#referencia-operativa","content":"Operador de infraestructura"},"1753":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview-53","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview#referencia-operativa","content":"Instalación, red, disponibilidad, dependencias y diagnóstico de despliegue."},"1754":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview-54","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/overview#referencia-operativa","content":"La Referencia API recoge los contratos para automatizar las operaciones. Para resolver un fallo, empieza en el bloque afectado: PKI, EST o Despliegue."},"1755":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","type":"page","content":"Jerarquía y rotación de CAs","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","PKI","Claves, autoridades y certificados"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation"},"1756":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","content":"Diseña autoridades raíz e intermedias y sustituye certificados o claves sin romper la confianza."},"1757":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation#diseña-la-jerarquía","content":"Diseña la jerarquía"},"1758":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/ca-hierarchy-and-rotation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/