diada por un motor de Lamassu. Al terminar tendrás una CA activa y su certificado público en `ca.pem`, preparado para verificar la emisión del siguiente recorrido."},"2405":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#antes-de-empezar","content":"Acceso a la consola y permisos para crear claves y autoridades."},"2406":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#antes-de-empezar","content":"Un motor criptográfico disponible que admita el algoritmo elegido."},"2407":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#antes-de-empezar","content":"OpenSSL 3.x para comprobar el certificado descargado."},"2408":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#antes-de-empezar","content":"Utiliza una instancia de evaluación o una autoridad destinada a estas pruebas. El ejemplo crea una raíz que emite directamente; para diseñar una jerarquía operativa, consulta Jerarquía y rotación."},"2409":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#abre-el-asistente-de-creación-toc","content":"En **Certification Authorities**, selecciona **Create New CA** y elige crear una CA con un par de claves nuevo."},"2410":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#abre-el-asistente-de-creación-toc","content":"El flujo &#x2A;*Create New CA (Existing Key)** se explica en la guía de autoridades."},"2411":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#selecciona-la-clave-toc","content":"Elige el motor que custodiará la clave y un algoritmo permitido por sus capacidades. Para este ejemplo puedes utilizar **EC P-384** si está disponible."},"2412":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#selecciona-la-clave-toc","content":"La clave privada de la CA se utiliza a través del motor. En este recorrido descargarás únicamente el certificado público de la autoridad."},"2413":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-la-autoridad-toc","content":"Selecciona **Root CA** y completa:"},"2414":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-la-autoridad-toc","content":"**CA Name**: `Acme Evaluation Root CA`."},"2415":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-la-autoridad-toc","content":"**Subject**: los datos de organización y país de tu evaluación."},"2416":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-la-autoridad-toc","content":"**CA Certificate Expiration**: por ejemplo, un año desde la creación."},"2417":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-la-autoridad-toc","content":"**Default End-Entity Certificate Issuance Expiration**: por ejemplo, 90 días, dentro de la vigencia de la CA."},"2418":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-la-autoridad-toc","content":"El nombre de la CA se utilizará como `Common Name`. Mantén los usos de CA necesarios para firmar certificados y CRLs."},"2419":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#revisa-y-crea-la-ca-toc","content":"Comprueba motor, algoritmo, sujeto, tipo raíz y fechas. Confirma la creación y anota el identificador de la autoridad para reconocerla en el DMS o en la API."},"2420":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#verifica-el-resultado-toc","content":"Abre la nueva CA. Debe aparecer activa, mostrar su certificado y permitir acceder a **Issued Certificates**."},"2421":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#verifica-el-resultado-toc","content":"Descarga o copia el certificado PEM de la autoridad y guárdalo como `ca.pem`. Comprueba que el archivo contiene el bloque completo, incluidos `BEGIN CERTIFICATE` y `END CERTIFICATE`."},"2422":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#comprueba-el-certi