ee el archivo, vuelve a copiar el bloque PEM completo."},"2427":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Si fallan la firma o las fechas, revisa que hayas descargado el certificado de esta CA y que el reloj del equipo sea correcto."},"2428":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"El diagnóstico PKI reúne las comprobaciones de emisión y dependencias criptográficas."},"2429":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#siguiente-paso","content":"Continúa con Emite y verifica un certificado, utilizando esta autoridad y `ca.pem`."},"2430":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"page","content":"Emite y verifica un certificado","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","PKI","Primeros pasos"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate"},"2431":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","con