so","content":"Siguiente paso"},"2444":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","content":"Emitirás un certificado final para `device-001` mediante el flujo de generación de clave y CSR en el navegador. Al terminar conservarás `device.crt`, `device.key` y el certificado público de la raíz emisora, `ca.pem`."},"2445":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#antes-de-empezar","content":"Una CA raíz activa con clave de firma disponible y permisos para emitir. Si todavía no existe, sigue Crea tu primera CA."},"2446":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#antes-de-empezar","content":"Su certificado público en `ca.pem`; este ejemplo utiliza la raíz creada en el recorrido anterior."},"2447":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#antes-de-empezar","content":"OpenSSL 3.x y un directorio de trabajo con acceso restringido."},"2448":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#antes-de-empezar","content":"Un identificador para el cliente: aquí usaremos `device-001`."},"2449":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#antes-de-empezar","content":"En este flujo la clave del cliente se genera en el navegador y debes descargarla al finalizar. Si la pierdes, tendrás que generar una clave y emitir otro certificado. El inventario de certificados permite descargar el certificado público, pero no recuperar esta clave."},"2450":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#inicia-la-emisión","content":"Abre la CA del recorrido anterior, entra en **Issued Certificates** y selecciona **Issue New**."},"2451":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#elige-el-método","content":"Selecciona **Generate Key & CSR in Browser** para seguir este ejemplo."},"2452":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#elige-el-método","content":"Si la clave debe generarse y permanecer en el sistema de destino, utiliza **Upload Existing CSR**, descrito en la guía de autoridades."},"2453":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#identifica-el-certificado","content":"Introduce `device-001` como `Common Name`. Añade los datos de sujeto requeridos por tu política y SANs si el consumidor los utiliza para identificar al cliente."},"2454":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#identifica-el-certificado","content":"Si vas a continuar con el registro manual, el `Device ID` será exactamente `device-001`."},"2455":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#configura-clave-y-usos","content":"Elige un algoritmo y tamaño admitidos por el perfil; por ejemplo, ECDSA P-256 si está permitido. Para este certificado de cliente, selecciona **Digital Signature** y **Client Authentication** y emite como certificado final."},"2456":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#configura-clave-y-usos","content":"Solicita, por ejemplo, 30 días de validez, siempre dentro de la vigencia de la CA. Revisa el perfil de emisión si el contenido resultante difiere de lo solicitado."},"2457":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#emite-y-descarga","content":"Confirma la emisión. Guarda el certificado PEM como `device.crt` y la clave privada como `device.key` en el directorio preparado."},"2458":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#verifica-el-resultado","content":"Comprueba en **Issued Certificates** que el certificado aparece activo. Anota su número de serie y verifica el material descargado con las comprobaciones siguientes."},"2459":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#inspecciona-contenido-y-fechas","content":"Comprueba `CN=device-001`, el emisor esperado, fechas vigentes, **Digital Signature** y el uso extendido **TLS Web Client Authentication**. Debe ser un certificado final: no debe declarar `CA:TRUE` ni habilitar **Certificate Sign**. Si **Basic Constraints** está presente, debe indicar `CA:FALSE`. Si solicitaste SANs, revisa que los identificadores esperados aparezcan en el certificado."},"2460":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#verifica-la-cadena","content":"El resultado esperado es `device.crt: OK`. Esta comprobación utiliza tu raíz explícita y evalúa la cadena, las fechas y la compatibilidad con el propósito de cliente TLS. La presencia de los usos y nombres esperados se comprueba también mediante la inspección anterior."},"2461":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#verifica-la-cadena","content":"Si utilizas una CA intermedia, la raíz confiable debe estar en `ca.pem` y debes aportar las intermedias mediante `-untrusted intermediates.pem`. Esta variante se desarrolla en el modelo de confianza."},"2462":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#verifica-la-cadena","content":"El comando no consulta OCSP ni CRL. Para comprobar revocación, continúa con Validación de certificados. Consulta la referencia de openssl-verify para sus opciones."},"2463":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#comprueba-que-la-clave-corresponde","content":"En Bash, compara los dos resúmenes de clave pública:"},"2464":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#comprueba-que-la-clave-corresponde","content":"Ambos comandos deben terminar correctamente y mostrar el mismo resumen SHA-256. Si difieren, la clave privada no corresponde al certificado seleccionado. Vuelve a localizar la pareja correcta antes de instalarla."},"2465":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#comprueba-que-la-clave-corresponde","content":"Las opciones utilizadas se recogen en openssl-x509 y openssl-pkey."},"2466":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Resultado"},"2467":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Qué revisar"},"2468":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"La CA rechaza la emisión"},"2469":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Permisos, estado y clave de la CA, algoritmo y perfil."},"2470":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Sujeto o usos diferentes"},"2471":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-40","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Perfil aplicado y valores solicitados."},"2472":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-41","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"No se encuentra el emisor"},"2473":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-42","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"CA descargada y cadena intermedia necesaria."},"2474":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-43","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Falla la vigencia"},"2475":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-44","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Fechas del certificado y de la CA, y reloj del equipo."},"2476":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-45","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Los resúmenes de clave difieren"},"2477":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-46","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Archivos de certificado y clave de la misma emisión."},"2478":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-47","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#si-el-resultado-falla","content":"Consulta Diagnóstico PKI si necesitas acotar un fallo de emisión."},"2479":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-48","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#siguiente-paso","content":"Has completado el recorrido PKI cuando el certificado verifica y su clave corresponde. Elige cómo utilizarlo:"},"2480":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-49","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#siguiente-paso","content":"Gestionar certificados para inspección, estado y revocación."},"2481":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-50","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#siguiente-paso","content":"Registrar un dispositivo manualmente para asociar esta identidad al inventario de Lamassu."},"2482":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-51","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#siguiente-paso","content":"Preparar EST para que el dispositivo solicite sus siguientes identidades."},"2483":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-52","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#siguiente-paso","content":"La aceptación en un consumidor requiere configurar su confianza, su comprobación de revocación y los permisos concedidos a la identidad."},"2484":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","type":"page","content":"Primeros pasos de PKI","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","PKI","Primeros pasos"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview"},"2485":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","content":"Crea una CA, emite un certificado de cliente y comprueba su cadena y su clave."},"2486":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview#antes-de-empezar","content":"Antes de empezar"},"2487":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview#ruta-recomendada","content":"Ruta recomendada"},"2488":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview#resultado-esperado","content":"Resultado esperado"},"2489":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview#continúa-según-tu-objetivo","content":"Continúa según tu objetivo"},"2490":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","content":"Este recorrido está dirigido a quien empieza a administrar la PKI o necesita una primera identidad X.509 de cliente. Termina con tres archivos: el certificado de una CA raíz, un certificado final y la clave privada de ese cliente."},"2491":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview#antes-de-empezar","content":"Una instancia de Lamassu accesible desde el navegador. Si necesitas prepararla, consulta Despliegue."},"2492":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview#antes-de-empezar","content":"Permisos para gestionar claves, autoridades y emisión. Consulta Control de acceso si una operación está bloqueada."},"2493":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview#antes-de-empezar","content":"Un motor criptográfico disponible para la clave de la CA; comprueba el inventario de claves y motores."},"2494":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview#antes-de-empezar","content":"OpenSSL 3.x en el equipo desde el que verificarás los archivos."},"2495":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview#antes-de-empezar","content":"Un directorio de trabajo con acceso restringido para custodiar la clave descargada."},"2496":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview#ruta-recomendada","content":"<Card title=\"1. Crea tu primera CA\" description=\"Crea una raíz de evaluación y guarda su certificado público como ca.pem.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority\" />"},"2497":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview#ruta-recomendada","content":"<Card title=\"2. Emite y verifica un certificado\" description=\"Emite para device-001 y comprueba contenido, cadena y correspondencia de clave.\" href=\"/docs/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate\" />"},"2498":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview#ruta-recomendada","content":"Usaremos `Acme Evaluation Root CA` y `device-001` como nombres de ejemplo. Si los sustituyes, conserva el mismo identificador de cliente en los pasos que quieras conectar."},"2499":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview#ruta-recomendada","content":"La raíz de este recorrido firma directamente el certificado final para facilitar la evaluación. Antes de diseñar una PKI operativa, revisa el modelo de confianza y la jerarquía de CAs."},"2500":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview#resultado-esperado","content":"Archivo o recurso"},"2501":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview#resultado-esperado","content":"Comprobación"},"2502":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview#resultado-esperado","content":"CA raíz activa y `ca.pem`"},"2503":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview#resultado-esperado","content":"Es un certificado de CA, está vigente y su autofirma se comprueba."},"2504":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview#resultado-esperado","content":"Certificado final y `device.crt`"},"2505":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview#resultado-esperado","content":"Identifica a `device-001`, admite autenticación de cliente y verifica hasta `ca.pem`."},"2506":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview#resultado-esperado","content":"Clave privada `device.key`"},"2507":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview#resultado-esperado","content":"Su clave pública coincide con la incluida en `device.crt`."},"2508":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview#resultado-esperado","content":"Estas comprobaciones validan el material emitido. La aceptación en un servicio requiere además su configuración de confianza, autorización y revocación."},"2509":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview#continúa-según-tu-objetivo","content":"Para operar certificados, continúa con Certificados y Validación."},"2510":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview#continúa-según-tu-objetivo","content":"Para gestionar una identidad de dispositivo en Lamassu, sigue Registro manual. Ese recorrido incluye la preparación del DMS."},"2511":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/overview#continúa-según-tu-objetivo","content":"Para que el dispositivo solicite su certificado, prepara el DMS y el cliente EST."},"2512":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"page","content":"Resolución de problemas PKI","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","PKI","Resolución de problemas"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting"},"2513":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","content":"Diagnostica emisión de certificados, OCSP y CRL."},"2514":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#la-emisión-falla","content":"La emisión falla"},"2515":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-o-crl-no-reflejan-un-cambio","content":"OCSP o CRL no reflejan un cambio"},"2516":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#la-cadena-se-valida-pero-la-conexión-falla","content":"La cadena se valida pero la conexión falla"},"2517":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","content":"Esta guía ayuda al operador PKI a localizar fallos de emisión y publicación de estado. Conserva versión de Lamassu, operación, CA, emisor, serie, hora y error devuelto. No incluyas claves privadas ni tokens en el diagnóstico."},"2518":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","content":"Para Gateway, inicio de sesión, pods, dependencias y mensajería, consulta Diagnóstico de Despliegue. Para enrolamiento de dispositivos, consulta Diagnóstico EST."},"2519":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#la-emisión-falla","content":"Comprobación"},"2520":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#la-emisión-falla","content":"Qué revisar"},"2521":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#la-emisión-falla","content":"Siguiente paso"},"2522":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#la-emisión-falla","content":"CA"},"2523":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#la-emisión-falla","content":"Existe, está activa y sus fechas son utilizables."},"2524":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#la-emisión-falla","content":"Autoridades."},"2525":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#la-emisión-falla","content":"Clave"},"2526":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#la-emisión-falla","content":"El registro tiene clave privada utilizable y el motor puede firmar."},"2527":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#la-emisión-falla","content":"Prueba **Sign / Verify** en KMS; revisa permisos y disponibilidad del proveedor."},"2528":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#la-emisión-falla","content":"CSR"},"2529":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#la-emisión-falla","content":"PEM correcto y firma verificable."},"2530":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#la-emisión-falla","content":"`openssl req -in request.csr -noout -verify -text`."},"2531":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#la-emisión-falla","content":"Perfil"},"2532":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#la-emisión-falla","content":"Fuente seleccionada, ID existente, algoritmo y tamaño admitidos."},"2533":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#la-emisión-falla","content":"Revisa la precedencia de Perfiles; CA y DMS resuelven de forma distinta."},"2534":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#la-emisión-falla","content":"Resultado"},"2535":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#la-emisión-falla","content":"Sujeto, SAN, usos y fechas adecuados."},"2536":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#la-emisión-falla","content":"Compara CSR, perfil y certificado; emitir correctamente no demuestra aceptación por el consumidor."},"2537":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#la-emisión-falla","content":"Si el certificado emitido tiene campos inesperados, revisa `Honor Subject`, `Honor Key Usage`, `Honor Extended Key Usages` y `Honor Extensions`. Esta última solo conserva SAN, sin validar el derecho a esos nombres. La validez no se recorta automáticamente al vencimiento de la CA."},"2538":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#la-emisión-falla","content":"Si falla la reemisión de una CA, comprueba revocación y fecha: no se admite para una CA revocada o ya vencida. Para cambiar la clave, utiliza Jerarquía y rotación."},"2539":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-o-crl-no-reflejan-un-cambio","content":"Revisa cada frontera por separado:"},"2540":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-o-crl-no-reflejan-un-cambio","content":"**Registro:** vuelve a leer el certificado correcto por serie y emisor. Confirma estado, razón y hora; los registros expirados o revocados definitivamente no admiten otra transición."},"2541":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-o-crl-no-reflejan-un-cambio","content":"**Endpoint:** inspecciona AIA y CDP del certificado. Consulta esas URLs desde la red del consumidor; una ruta antigua o un emisor incorrecto puede explicar la diferencia."},"2542":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-o-crl-no-reflejan-un-cambio","content":"**OCSP:** guarda una respuesta nueva, verifica firma y tiempos y observa su estado. Un error HTTP por una serie ausente no equivale a `Good` ni garantiza un `Unknown` firmado."},"2543":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-o-crl-no-reflejan-un-cambio","content":"**CRL:** compara `latest_crl`, número y tiempos de la lista descargada. Confirma la serie en el contenido. Si no cambia, revisa `regenerate_on_revoke`, entrega del evento, trabajos, firma y almacenamiento con el operador de Despliegue."},"2544":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-o-crl-no-reflejan-un-cambio","content":"**Cliente:** comprueba caché, política ante evidencia vencida o no disponible, extensión IDP crítica y rechazo de una conexión nueva."},"2545":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#ocsp-o-crl-no-reflejan-un-cambio","content":"Una reactivación desde `CertificateHold` requiere una CRL nueva para que el cliente deje de ver la suspensión. Reactivar una CA no restaura su cascada de descendientes; revisa todos los estados y los errores individuales de la operación."},"2546":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#la-cadena-se-valida-pero-la-conexión-falla","content":"Comprueba la identidad esperada, SAN, KU/EKU, clave correspondiente, intermedias enviadas y permisos del consumidor. Diferencia confianza TLS en el servidor, autenticación del cliente y autorización de la acción. Sigue Validación para una prueba positiva y otras de rechazo."},"2547":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/pki/troubleshooting#la-cadena-se-valida-pero-la-conexión-falla","content":"Cuando necesites escalar un problema, entrega los identificadores, error y evidencia pública relevante, con tiempos de consulta y versión. Esto permite distinguir un fallo de emisión, de publicación o de la aplicación consumidora."},"2548":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture","type":"page","content":"Arquitectura","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Actualizaciones","Conceptos"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture"},"2549":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture","content":"Los componentes de Lamassu Updates, cómo se conectan en cada backend y qué se ejecuta en segundo plano."},"2550":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture#modo-nativo","content":"Modo nativo"},"2551":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture#cómo-se-conectan-los-dispositivos","content":"Cómo se conectan los dispositivos"},"2552":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture#modo-hawkbit","content":"Modo hawkBit"},"2553":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture#cómo-se-conectan-los-dispositivos-1","content":"Cómo se conectan los dispositivos"},"2554":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture#qué-se-ejecuta-dentro-del-servicio","content":"Qué se ejecuta dentro del servicio"},"2555":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture#dependencias","content":"Dependencias"},"2556":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture#dónde-se-almacena-cada-cosa","content":"Dónde se almacena cada cosa"},"2557":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture#ejecutar-más-de-una-réplica","content":"Ejecutar más de una réplica"},"2558":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture#siguientes-pasos","content":"Siguientes pasos"},"2559":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture","content":"Lamassu Updates es un único proceso que sirve la API de Updates (`/updates/v1`) y, embebido en ella, SymKMS (`/symkms/v1`). También responde a `GET /health`. Detrás de la API hay dos backends intercambiables. El ajuste `mode` elige uno al arrancar el servicio. Los clientes, incluido el dashboard de Lamassu, no pueden distinguirlos salvo a través de las capacidades."},"2560":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture#modo-nativo","content":"En modo nativo el servicio es dueño de los datos. Postgres guarda paquetes, lanzamientos e historial de dispositivos, WFX guarda un job por dispositivo, y el servicio gobierna ambos."},"2561":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture#modo-nativo","content":"El servicio es un único proceso. Sus partes, y cuáles usan cada dependencia, están en Qué se ejecuta dentro del servicio."},"2562":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture#cómo-se-conectan-los-dispositivos","content":"Un dispositivo nunca habla con el servicio salvo para descargar su paquete. Consulta a WFX los jobs y le notifica cada cambio de estado. El servicio se entera de los cambios por el flujo de eventos de WFX."},"2563":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture#cómo-se-conectan-los-dispositivos","content":"La dirección de descarga de cada job es la ruta de descarga del paquete bajo `update_domain`, con el ID del dispositivo añadido para que funcionen los paquetes por dispositivo y la autorización en el gateway. Cuando el almacén de blobs `builds` está en S3 con las descargas prefirmadas activadas, una descarga se responde con un `302` a una URL firmada de corta duración del objeto, en lugar de transmitir los bytes a través del servicio. El almacenamiento local siempre transmite. Ambos admiten peticiones `Range`, así que una descarga interrumpida se reanuda."},"2564":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture#modo-hawkbit","content":"En modo hawkBit el servicio es un gateway. Los paquetes se convierten en distribution sets, los lanzamientos en rollouts, y hawkBit es dueño de esos datos y se lee en vivo en cada petición. El servicio guarda en Postgres solo lo que hawkBit no tiene dónde almacenar. Consulta el Modelo de datos."},"2565":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture#cómo-se-conectan-los-dispositivos-1","content":"Los dispositivos hablan con hawkBit y nunca con este servicio para consultar. Consultan la API DDI de hawkBit y le envían su feedback. El servicio lee el progreso de hawkBit cada vez que se le pide, y no tiene ningún flujo de eventos que seguir."},"2566":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture#cómo-se-conectan-los-dispositivos-1","content":"La descarga del artefacto también puede pasar por este servicio. Sirve la ruta de artefactos de dispositivo de hawkBit (`/{tenant}/controller/v1/{controllerId}/softwaremodules/{id}/artifacts/{filename}`, bajo la ruta de `hawkbit.ddi_url`) sin reescribirla, de modo que un gateway delante de ambos siga aplicando sus reglas de autorización. El servicio solo responde por un módulo asignado o instalado en ese dispositivo, y en caso contrario devuelve `404`. Con el prefirmado activado en `hawkbit.artifact_store`, redirige (`302`) a una URL firmada del bucket S3 de hawkBit. Consulta Conectar un dispositivo."},"2567":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture#qué-se-ejecuta-dentro-del-servicio","content":"Parte"},"2568":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture#qué-se-ejecuta-dentro-del-servicio","content":"Qué hace"},"2569":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture#qué-se-ejecuta-dentro-del-servicio","content":"Nativo"},"2570":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture#qué-se-ejecuta-dentro-del-servicio","content":"hawkBit"},"2571":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture#qué-se-ejecuta-dentro-del-servicio","content":"API de Updates"},"2572":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture#qué-se-ejecuta-dentro-del-servicio","content":"Paquetes, módulos, artefactos, lanzamientos, inventario de dispositivos, cumplimiento de versiones"},"2573":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture#qué-se-ejecuta-dentro-del-servicio","content":"Sí"},"2574":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture#qué-se-ejecuta-dentro-del-servicio","content":"Sí (traducida a llamadas a hawkBit)"},"2575":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architectu