servicio","content":"Sí"},"2582":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture#qué-se-ejecuta-dentro-del-servicio","content":"Sí (por módulo), si `swugenerator_path` está definido"},"2583":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture#qué-se-ejecuta-dentro-del-servicio","content":"Almacenes de blobs"},"2584":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture#qué-se-ejecuta-dentro-del-servicio","content":"Artefactos, builds y claves, en disco local o S3, opcionalmente cifrados en reposo"},"2585":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture#qué-se-ejecuta-dentro-del-servicio","content":"Sí"},"2586":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture#qué-se-ejecuta-dentro-del-servicio","content":"Solo claves (los bytes de los artefactos viven en el almacén de artefactos de hawkBit)"},"2587":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture#qué-se-ejecuta-dentro-del-servicio","content":"Consumidor de eventos de WFX"},"2588":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture#qué-se-ejecuta-dentro-del-servicio","content":"Lee el flujo de eventos server-sent de WFX, actualiza el estado de cada dispositivo en su lanzamiento y libera el siguiente lote"},"2589":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture-40","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture#qué-se-ejecuta-dentro-del-servicio","content":"Sí"},"2590":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture-41","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture#qué-se-ejecuta-dentro-del-servicio","content":"No"},"2591":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture-42","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture#qué-se-ejecuta-dentro-del-servicio","content":"Disparador de lanzamientos programados"},"2592":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture-43","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture#qué-se-ejecuta-dentro-del-servicio","content":"Inicia los lanzamientos cuyo `scheduled_at` ha pasado, consultando cada 30 segundos, y repara los lotes cuyo envío se interrumpió"},"2593":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture-44","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/architecture#qué-se-ejecuta-dentro-del-servicio","content":"Sí"},"2594":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates