 al crear"},"3496":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#1-crea-el-paquete","content":"`packaging`"},"3497":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#1-crea-el-paquete","content":"`swu` (por defecto) o `non-swu`. Un paquete `non-swu` entrega sus ficheros como un `.tar.gz` y usa el workflow `download-install`"},"3498":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#1-crea-el-paquete","content":"`allow_previous_version_download`"},"3499":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#1-crea-el-paquete","content":"Opcional. Permite que los dispositivos descarguen versiones anteriores del paquete"},"3500":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#1-crea-el-paquete","content":"`preconditions`"},"3501":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#1-crea-el-paquete","content":"Opcional. Reglas que un dispositivo debe cumplir para recibir el paquete. Consulta Conceptos"},"3502":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#1-crea-el-paquete","content":"`modules`"},"3503":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#1-crea-el-paquete","content":"**Solo modo hawkBit**: la composición del paquete, como módulos del catálogo ya construidos. El modo nativo lo ignora"},"3504":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#2-sube-el-sw-description-y-el-artefacto","content":"El `sw-description` es un fichero de SWUpdate que enumera lo que instala el dispositivo. Su formato es el de SWUpdate, y la documentación de SWUpdate es la referencia. Cuando el servicio construye el `.swu`, `swugenerator` lee este fichero y los binarios preparados, así que el `filename` de cada imagen debe ser el nombre de un fichero subido. Un ejemplo mínimo:"},"3505":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#2-sube-el-sw-description-y-el-artefacto","content":"`swugenerator` rellena el `filename` final (con `.zlib` añadido, y `.enc` en los ficheros cifrados), el `sha256` y, en los ficheros cifrados, la propiedad `ivt`. Para una construcción cifrada, añade `encrypted = true;` a cada imagen que deba cifrarse. Dos reglas causan la mayoría de los fallos:"},"3506":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-40","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#2-sube-el-sw-description-y-el-artefacto","content":"`encrypted = true` solo debe aparecer en una construcción que aporte una clave (la construcción falla sin ella), y una construcción por dispositivo rechaza una descripción en la que ninguna imagen lo tenga."},"3507":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-41","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#2-sube-el-sw-description-y-el-artefacto","content":"Las imágenes comprimidas necesitan `decompressed-size`."},"3508":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-42","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#2-sube-el-sw-description-y-el-artefacto","content":"Si construyes tú el `.swu` y lo subes como entregable prefabricado, rellenas tú mismo `sha256` e `ivt`, y el `sha256` es sobre los bytes que descarga el dispositivo, porque SWUpdate calcula el hash antes de descifrar."},"3509":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-43","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#2-sube-el-sw-description-y-el-artefacto","content":"`artifact_name` es por defecto el nombre del fichero sin su extensión. `version` es opcional; cuando subes un fichero nuevo con un `artifact_name` existente, debe ser estrictamente mayor que la versión más alta ya guardada con ese nombre."},"3510":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-44","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#2-sube-el-sw-description-y-el-artefacto","content":"El artefacto se guarda como artefacto global y se enlaza a este paquete. La respuesta contiene su `id`. Para reutilizar un artefacto ya subido, enlázalo con `POST .../artifact/link` y `{\"artifact_id\":\"<id>\"}`."},"3511":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-45","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#2-sube-el-sw-description-y-el-artefacto","content":"El fichero más grande admitido es `max_artifact_size_mb` (10 GiB por defecto). Una subida mayor responde `413`."},"3512":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-46","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#2-sube-el-sw-description-y-el-artefacto","content":"Una vez construido el paquete, las subidas y los enlaces responden `409`: crea antes una versión nueva."},"3513":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-47","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#compón-un-paquete-con-varios-módulos-opcional","content":"Un paquete nativo es una composición de módulos de software: un módulo `os` más cualquier número de módulos `application`. Un paquete sin módulos declarados se comporta como un único módulo `os` implícito que posee los artefactos que subiste antes. Para añadir un módulo de aplicación y darle sus propios ficheros:"},"3514":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-48","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#compón-un-paquete-con-varios-módulos-opcional","content":"La clave del módulo es `<type>:<name>`. El modo nativo sigue construyendo un único `.swu` para todo el paquete, a partir de los artefactos de todos los módulos y del único `sw-description` del paquete. También puedes componer desde un módulo que ya existe con `POST .../modules/import`; en modo nativo eso copia el módulo, mientras que en modo hawkBit enlaza el mismo módulo. Consulta Conceptos para el modelo."},"3515":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-49","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#3-construye-el-entregable","content":"`selected_artifact_ids` es lo que mete artefactos en la construcción: solo se preparan los listados. Con una lista vacía la construcción falla porque no se preparó ningún binario, y el paquete pasa a `build_failed`. Toma el ID de la respuesta de la subida del artefacto, o de `GET $API/artifacts`."},"3516":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-50","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#3-construye-el-entregable","content":"El cuerpo anterior construye un `.swu` sin cifrar y sin firmar. Para firmar o cifrar, añade campos como se describe en Firma y cifrado."},"3517":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-51","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#3-construye-el-entregable","content":"Para un paquete `non-swu`, llama a `POST .../package` en lugar de `.../swu`. Sin `selected_artifact_ids` empaqueta los artefactos enlazados al paquete."},"3518":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-52","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#3-construye-el-entregable","content":"Para entregar un fichero que construiste por tu cuenta, súbelo a `POST .../swu/upload` (o `.../package/upload`) como un `file` multipart. Se guarda y se sirve sin cambios, así que ya debe estar firmado y cifrado como esperan tus dispositivos. Solo modo nativo."},"3519":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-53","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#3-construye-el-entregable","content":"Cuando la construcción termina bien, el paquete pasa a `built` y sus artefactos y su composición son inmutables. Si falla, el paquete pasa a `build_failed` y `last_build_error` guarda el motivo: corrige la entrada y construye de nuevo. Una construcción que se ejecuta mientras otra tiene bloqueado el mismo paquete responde `409`."},"3520":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-54","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#4-crea-el-lanzamiento","content":"El lanzamiento apunta a todos los dispositivos del grupo en el momento de crearlo, y necesita un paquete construido. La respuesta es `201` con `launch_id`, `precondition_failures`, `forced` y, en modo hawkBit, `superseded_devices` y `never_seen_devices`."},"3521":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-55","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#4-crea-el-lanzamiento","content":"Campo"},"3522":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-56","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#4-crea-el-lanzamiento","content":"Notas"},"3523":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-57","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#4-crea-el-lanzamiento","content":"`distribution_set_name`, `workflow_type`, `rollout_type`, `rollout_value`"},"3524":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-58","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#4-crea-el-lanzamiento","content":"Obligatorios. `rollout_value` debe ser mayor que 0"},"3525":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-59","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#4-crea-el-lanzamiento","content":"`rollout_type`"},"3526":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-60","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#4-crea-el-lanzamiento","content":"`percentage` del grupo por lote, o `fixed` (un número de dispositivos). Cualquier valor distinto de `percentage` se interpreta como un número"},"3527":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-61","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#4-crea-el-lanzamiento","content":"`workflow_type`"},"3528":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-62","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#4-crea-el-lanzamiento","content":"Nativo: `direct`, `phased`, `download-install`, o el nombre completo de otro workflow registrado en WFX (`GET $API/workflows`). hawkBit: `phased` crea una acción soft, cualquier otro valor una forced"},"3529":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-63","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#4-crea-el-lanzamiento","content":"`test_device_id`"},"3530":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-64","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#4-crea-el-lanzamiento","content":"Canario opcional: un miembro del grupo que se actualiza primero y debe tener éxito antes de tocar ningún otro dispositivo"},"3531":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-65","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#4-crea-el-lanzamiento","content":"`auto`, `approval_threshold`, `error_threshold`"},"3532":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-66","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#4-crea-el-lanzamiento","content":"Opcionales. `auto` libera los lotes siguientes por sí solo. Ambos umbrales son porcentajes de 0 a 100"},"3533":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-67","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#4-crea-el-lanzamiento","content":"`scheduled_at`"},"3534":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-68","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#4-crea-el-lanzamiento","content":"Hora RFC 3339 opcional. El primer lote se retrasa hasta entonces"},"3535":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-69","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#4-crea-el-lanzamiento","content":"`name`, `description`, `weight`"},"3536":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-70","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#4-crea-el-lanzamiento","content":"Opcionales. `name` es por defecto el nombre del paquete. `weight` (de 0 a 1000) se guarda pero nada lo lee"},"3537":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-71","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#4-crea-el-lanzamiento","content":"`force_preconditions`"},"3538":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-72","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#4-crea-el-lanzamiento","content":"Despliega también en los dispositivos que no cumplen las precondiciones del paquete. Los fallos se registran igualmente"},"3539":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-73","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#4-crea-el-lanzamiento","content":"Elige el workflow según el paquete:"},"3540":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-74","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#4-crea-el-lanzamiento","content":"Usa `direct` para paquetes SWU salvo que gestiones WFX tú mismo. El workflow `phased` tiene pasos que WFX o un operador deben confirmar, y este servicio no los avanza. Un lanzamiento `phased` se queda en su primer estado hasta que alguien lo confirma a través de WFX."},"3541":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-75","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#4-crea-el-lanzamiento","content":"Para un paquete `non-swu`, pon `workflow_type` a `download-install`. El lanzamiento usa el valor que indicas tal cual, así que `direct` ejecutaría el workflow SWU y la actualización parecería atascada cuando el dispositivo ya terminó."},"3542":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-76","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#4-crea-el-lanzamiento","content":"En modo hawkBit no hay WFX. La elección es el modo de instalación de hawkBit."},"3543":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-77","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#4-crea-el-lanzamiento","content":"Si el paquete tiene precondiciones, previsualiza qué dispositivos cumplen antes de crear nada añadiendo `?dry_run=true` a la misma petición. Responde `200` con `qualifying_devices`, `precondition_failures`, `superseded_devices` y `never_seen_devices`, y no crea nada."},"3544":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-78","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#4-crea-el-lanzamiento","content":"**Umbrales de aprobación y de error.** Con `auto: true`, el siguiente lote se libera cuando al menos `approval_threshold` por ciento del lote actual ha tenido éxito (0 significa el lote completo). En modo nativo, la campaña se cancela cuando `error_threshold` por ciento de todos sus dispositivos ha fallado; en modo hawkBit se detiene cuando falla más de ese porcentaje de un lote. En cambio, un canario fallido pausa una campaña nativa: reanúdala para reintentar el canario."},"3545":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-79","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#4-crea-el-lanzamiento","content":"Toma el ID del lanzamiento de la respuesta. Es `$LAUNCH` más abajo."},"3546":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-80","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#5-lánzalo","content":"Sin `auto`, cada llamada despacha el siguiente lote (primero el canario, si lo definiste). Con `auto: true`, llama una vez para iniciar el primer lote: el servicio libera después los demás lotes por sí solo al cumplirse el umbral de aprobación, y las llamadas posteriores responden `400`. Si el lanzamiento tiene un `scheduled_at` futuro, la llamada se acepta pero no hace nada: el servicio lo inicia solo a esa hora (el modo nativo comprueba cada 30 segundos; en hawkBit inicia el rollout el propio planificador de hawkBit)."},"3547":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-81","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#5-lánzalo","content":"Un lanzamiento nativo pasa por estos estados:"},"3548":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-82","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#5-lánzalo","content":"Puedes dirigir un lanzamiento mientras se ejecuta:"},"3549":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-83","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#5-lánzalo","content":"Acción"},"3550":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-84","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#5-lánzalo","content":"Petición"},"3551":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-85","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#5-lánzalo","content":"Efecto"},"3552":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-86","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#5-lánzalo","content":"Pausar"},"3553":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-87","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#5-lánzalo","content":"`POST $API/groups/$GROUP/launch/$LAUNCH/pause`"},"3554":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-88","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#5-lánzalo","content":"No hay más lotes hasta reanudar. Los dispositivos que ya están en curso terminan"},"3555":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-89","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#5-lánzalo","content":"Reanudar"},"3556":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-90","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#5-lánzalo","content":"`POST .../resume`"},"3557":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-91","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#5-lánzalo","content":"Nativo: una campaña automática libera su siguiente lote de inmediato si el actual ya cumplió el umbral, y reanudar tras un canario fallido lo reintenta"},"3558":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-92","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#5-lánzalo","content":"Reintentar dispositivos fallidos"},"3559":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-93","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#5-lánzalo","content":"`POST .../retry-failed`"},"3560":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-94","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#5-lánzalo","content":"Vuelve a poner en cola los dispositivos fallidos y los despacha. Responde `400` si no hay ninguno"},"3561":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-95","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#5-lánzalo","content":"Cancelar (terminal)"},"3562":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-96","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#5-lánzalo","content":"`POST .../cancel`"},"3563":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-97","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#5-lánzalo","content":"Los dispositivos pendientes no se actualizan"},"3564":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-98","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#5-lánzalo","content":"Marcar como completado (terminal)"},"3565":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-99","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#5-lánzalo","content":"`POST .../complete`"},"3566":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-100","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#5-lánzalo","content":"No disponible en modo hawkBit"},"3567":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-101","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#5-lánzalo","content":"Leer o cambiar la estrategia"},"3568":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-102","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#5-lánzalo","content":"`GET`, `PUT .../strategy`"},"3569":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-103","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#5-lánzalo","content":"Cambiarla no está disponible en modo hawkBit"},"3570":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-104","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#5-lánzalo","content":"En modo hawkBit, un rollout solo se puede pausar después de que haya empezado a despachar."},"3571":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-105","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#verifica-el-resultado","content":"El listado de lanzamientos responde `{\"list\":[...],\"next\":\"...\"}`. Un lanzamiento ha terminado cuando `pending_count` y `active_count` valen cero; un lanzamiento nativo pone entonces su `status` en `completed` por sí solo. Los dispositivos terminan como `completed` (estado del trabajo `ACTIVATED`, o `INSTALLED` para `non-swu`) o `failed` (`TERMINATED`)."},"3572":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-106","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#publica-la-siguiente-versión","content":"Una versión construida de un paquete es inmutable. Para cambiarla, crea la versión siguiente, sube lo que haya cambiado y construye de nuevo:"},"3573":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-107","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#publica-la-siguiente-versión","content":"La versión debe ser estrictamente mayor que la actual. La versión nueva empieza sin construir y arrastra los artefactos actuales."},"3574":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-108","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#publica-la-siguiente-versión","content":"Para actualizar un dispositivo a una versión exacta sin campaña, usa `POST $API/devices/<device-id>/force-version` con `{\"distribution_set_id\":\"<pack id>\",\"version\":\"1.1.0\"}`; en modo nativo crea un lanzamiento de un solo dispositivo y usa por defecto el workflow `phased` para paquetes SWU (`download-install` para `non-swu`), salvo que indiques un `workflow`."},"3575":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-109","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#modo-hawkbit","content":"Los paquetes de hawkBit se ensamblan a partir de módulos del catálogo ya construidos, así que los pasos 2 y 3 del lado del paquete pasan al catálogo:"},"3576":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-110","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#modo-hawkbit","content":"Crea el módulo: `POST $API/softwaremodules` con `type` (`os` o `application`), `name`, `version` y un `delivery_intent`: `swu-build`, `swu-prebuilt` o `raw`. `undecided` se acepta, pero un módulo no puede entrar en un paquete hasta que elijas."},"3577":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-111","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#modo-hawkbit","content":"Sube el fichero con `POST $API/softwaremodules/by-id/<id>/artifacts`. Para `swu-build`, sube también el `sw-description` a `.../descriptor` y llama a `POST $API/softwaremodules/by-id/<id>/build`. Para `swu-prebuilt`, subir el `.swu` es la construcción. Para `raw`, llama a `.../build` para que los ficheros sean el entregable; firmar y cifrar es opcional."},"3578":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-112","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#modo-hawkbit","content":"Crea el paquete con `\"modules\":[{\"source_module_id\":\"<id>\"}]`. Se crea ya construido."},"3579":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-113","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#modo-hawkbit","content":"Después continúa en el paso 4. Los detalles, incluidas las intenciones de entrega, están en Modo hawkBit, y una secuencia completa de peticiones en la guía curl de hawkBit."},"3580":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-114","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#solución-de-problemas","content":"Síntoma"},"3581":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-115","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#solución-de-problemas","content":"Causa probable"},"3582":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-116","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#solución-de-problemas","content":"Una llamada devuelve `501 Not Implemented`"},"3583":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-117","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#solución-de-problemas","content":"El backend activo no la admite. Consulta Capacidades"},"3584":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-118","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#solución-de-problemas","content":"`400` «has not been built yet» al crear un lanzamiento"},"3585":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-119","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#solución-de-problemas","content":"El paquete está en `draft` o `build_failed`. Constrúyelo primero"},"3586":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-120","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#solución-de-problemas","content":"`400` sobre dispositivos sin paquete"},"3587":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-121","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#solución-de-problemas","content":"Un paquete cifrado por dispositivo se construyó solo para algunos. El mensaje nombra los dispositivos sin clave; corrígelos y reconstruye"},"3588":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-122","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#solución-de-problemas","content":"`400` «group has no devices to launch to»"},"3589":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-123","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publ