o entregable"},"4711":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities-85","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities#soporte-por-backend","content":"**No**"},"4712":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities-86","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities#soporte-por-backend","content":"Sí"},"4713":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities-87","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities#soporte-por-backend","content":"`standalone_software_modules`: crear un módulo sin pack"},"4714":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities-88","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities#soporte-por-backend","content":"Sí"},"4715":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities-89","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities#soporte-por-backend","content":"Condicional"},"4716":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities-90","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities#soporte-por-backend","content":"`software_module_replace`: sustituir un módulo por otra versión de sí mismo"},"4717":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities-91","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities#soporte-por-backend","content":"**No**"},"4718":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities-92","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities#soporte-por-backend","content":"Condicional"},"4719":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities-93","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities#capacidades-condicionales-en-modo-hawkbit","content":"**`artifact_encryption`** se informa como no admitida solo cuando no está configurado ninguno de `swugenerator_path`, `symkms_endpoint` y `kms_endpoint`. Cada opción de compilación sigue necesitando su propia configuración: consulta Firma y cifrado."},"4720":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities-94","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities#capacidades-condicionales-en-modo-hawkbit","content":"**`software_module_composition`, `standalone_software_modules` y `software_module_replace`** dependen de que el servidor hawkBit tenga los tipos de módulo preinstalados `os` y `application` y el tipo de conjunto `os_app` o `app`. El servicio lo sondea con un timeout de 5 segundos, guarda el resultado unos cinco minutos y asume que hay soporte cuando hawkBit no responde. Si el sondeo falla, las tres capacidades se informan juntas como no admitidas."},"4721":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities-95","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities#capacidades-condicionales-en-modo-hawkbit","content":"**`software_module_deliverables`** siempre se informa como admitida en modo hawkBit. Compilar un módulo `swu-build` sigue necesitando un `swugenerator_path`; sin él, la compilación responde `501`."},"4722":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities-96","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities#capacidades-condicionales-en-modo-hawkbit","content":"**`prebuilt_deliverable`**: un pack de hawkBit nunca se compila directamente. Un módulo `swu-prebuilt` del catálogo acepta en su lugar un `.swu` terminado."},"4723":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities-97","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities#capacidades-cuyo-significado-cambia","content":"Ambos backends informan `software_module_composition`, pero importar un módulo lo **enlaza** en modo hawkBit (ambos packs comparten un único módulo) y lo **copia** en modo native. La lista de módulos reutilizables lo indica por candidato en su campo `shared`, de modo que un cliente puede decirle al operador cuál de los dos casos tiene. Consulta Conceptos."},"4724":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities-98","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities#capacidades-cuyo-significado-cambia","content":"En modo native un lanzamiento despacha un job por dispositivo con una única URI de descarga, así que un módulo no tiene entregable propio: el pack compila un único `.swu` a partir de las entradas de todos sus módulos. Por eso `software_module_deliverables` y `software_module_replace` no están admitidas allí."},"4725":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities-99","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities#qué-debe-hacer-un-cliente","content":"Llama a `capabilities` una vez al arrancar y antes de mostrar una función que la tabla marque como dependiente del backend."},"4726":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities-100","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities#qué-debe-hacer-un-cliente","content":"Trata un `501` en una ruta como definitivo: oculta la acción en lugar de reintentar."},"4727":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities-101","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities#qué-debe-hacer-un-cliente","content":"No deduzcas el backend por la URL. Ambos sirven las mismas rutas `/updates/v1`; consulta la Referencia de la API para saber qué rutas responden `501` en cada backend."},"4728":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities-102","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities#qué-debe-hacer-un-cliente","content":"Vuelve a leer las capacidades tras cambiar los tipos de módulo de hawkBit o la configuración de compilación."},"4729":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities-103","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities#siguientes-pasos","content":"Referencia de la API"},"4730":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities-104","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities#siguientes-pasos","content":"Modo hawkBit"},"4731":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","type":"page","content":"Referencia de configuración","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Actualizaciones","Referencia"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration"},"4732":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","content":"Todas las claves de configuración de Lamassu Updates, su valor por defecto, qué backend las lee y cómo sobrescribirlas con variables de entorno."},"4733":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#cómo-se-carga-la-configuración","content":"Cómo se carga la configuración"},"4734":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#qué-claves-lee-cada-modo","content":"Qué claves lee cada modo"},"4735":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#ajustes-generales-y-del-servidor","content":"Ajustes generales y del servidor"},"4736":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#base-de-datos","content":"Base de datos"},"4737":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#endpoints-de-otros-servicios","content":"Endpoints de otros servicios"},"4738":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#construcción-y-firma","content":"Construcción y firma"},"4739":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#límites-de-subida","content":"Límites de subida"},"4740":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#bloques-de-almacenamiento-de-blobs","content":"Bloques de almacenamiento de blobs"},"4741":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/re