onfiguration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#cómo-se-carga-la-configuración","content":"`config-hawkbit.yml`"},"4763":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#cómo-se-carga-la-configuración","content":"Desarrollo local en modo `hawkbit` contra el hawkBit del fichero compose (puerto 8090 del host)"},"4764":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#cómo-se-carga-la-configuración","content":"Los ejemplos contienen valores de una máquina de desarrollo (rutas absolutas y direcciones de red local) y secretos de desarrollo. Sustitúyelos todos y no reutilices nunca sus claves ni contraseñas."},"4765":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#qué-claves-lee-cada-modo","content":"Clave"},"4766":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#qué-claves-lee-cada-modo","content":"`native`"},"4767":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#qué-claves-lee-cada-modo","content