orm/updates/reference/configuration#cifrado-en-reposo-encryption","content":"ninguno"},"4976":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-244","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#cifrado-en-reposo-encryption","content":"Obligatoria para `local`: una clave de 32 bytes codificada en hexadecimal."},"4977":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-245","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#cifrado-en-reposo-encryption","content":"`awskms_key_id`"},"4978":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-246","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#cifrado-en-reposo-encryption","content":"ninguno"},"4979":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-247","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#cifrado-en-reposo-encryption","content":"Obligatoria para `awskms`: ARN o alias de la clave."},"4980":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-248","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#cifrado-en-reposo-encryption","content":"`awskms_region`"},"4981":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-249","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#cifrado-en-reposo-encryption","content":"`us-east-1`"},"4982":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-250","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#cifrado-en-reposo-encryption","content":"Región de la clave de AWS KMS."},"4983":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-251","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#cifrado-en-reposo-encryption","content":"Un objeto cifrado se cifra y descifra entero, en memoria: con cifrado en reposo, leer o escribir un artefacto de 10 GiB necesita esa misma memoria, y los rangos de bytes se cortan de la copia descifrada. Un almacén con el cifrado activado no puede usar descargas prefirmadas. Para ficheros grandes, es preferible cifrar en el propio almacén (por ejemplo, con cifrado del lado del servidor de S3)."},"4984":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-252","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#descargas-prefirmadas-presign","content":"Con almacenamiento S3, una descarga puede responderse con `302` a una URL firmada de corta duración del almacén, en lugar de transmitir los bytes a través del servicio. Antes se autoriza al solicitante, como en cualquier descarga. El modo `native` firma las salidas de compilación (`builds.presign`); el modo `hawkbit` firma los objetos del plugin S3 de hawkBit (`hawkbit.artifact_store.presign`). Las descargas de artefactos por ID en modo `native` siempre se transmiten a través del servicio."},"4985":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-253","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#descargas-prefirmadas-presign","content":"Clave"},"4986":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-254","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#descargas-prefirmadas-presign","content":"Por defecto"},"4987":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-255","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#descargas-prefirmadas-presign","content":"Descripción"},"4988":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-256","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#descargas-prefirmadas-presign","content":"`enabled`"},"4989":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-257","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#descargas-prefirmadas-presign","content":"`false`"},"4990":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-258","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#descargas-prefirmadas-presign","content":"Activa la función."},"4991":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-259","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#descargas-prefirmadas-presign","content":"`public_endpoint`"},"4992":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-260","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#descargas-prefirmadas-presign","content":"el `s3_endpoint` del almacenamiento"},"4993":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-261","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#descargas-prefirmadas-presign","content":"Origen del almacén **tal como lo alcanzan los dispositivos**, sin ruta (por ejemplo, el gateway que publica el bucket). Es lo que se firma: la firma cubre la cabecera `Host`, así que una URL firmada para una dirección interna del clúster se rechaza cuando un dispositivo la usa a través del gateway. Obligatoria salvo que los dispositivos alcancen el almacén en su propio endpoint (por ejemplo, AWS S3)."},"4994":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-262","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#descargas-prefirmadas-presign","content":"`ttl`"},"4995":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-263","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#descargas-prefirmadas-presign","content":"`60s`"},"4996":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-264","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#descargas-prefirmadas-presign","content":"Cuánto tiempo puede una URL **iniciar** una descarga. Entre `1s` y 7 días. Una transferencia ya en curso no se corta al caducar."},"4997":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-265","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#descargas-prefirmadas-presign","content":"`min_remaining`"},"4998":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-266","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#descargas-prefirmadas-presign","content":"`min(25s, ttl/2)`"},"4999":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-267","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#descargas-prefirmadas-presign","content":"Una URL ya firmada para el mismo objeto se entrega de nuevo mientras le quede al menos esta validez, de modo que un reintento o una reanudación nunca recibe una URL a punto de caducar. Un valor negativo firma una URL nueva en cada petición. Debe ser menor que `ttl`."},"5000":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-268","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#descargas-prefirmadas-presign","content":"`access_key_id`, `secret_access_key` (o las variantes `_file`)"},"5001":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-269","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#descargas-prefirmadas-presign","content":"ninguno"},"5002":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-270","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#descargas-prefirmadas-presign","content":"La credencial que firma. &#x2A;*Obligatoria, y debe ser una credencial de solo lectura distinta de la del almacenamiento.**"},"5003":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-271","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#descargas-prefirmadas-presign","content":"Al arrancar, el servicio se niega a ejecutarse si la credencial de firma es la del almacenamiento, si puede escribir en el bucket (lo comprueba intentando una escritura), si el almacén la rechaza (espera hasta 2 minutos a que el almacén la acepte) o si `encryption.type` no es `none` (los dispositivos recibirían texto cifrado). Si no se puede consultar el almacén en absoluto, registra una advertencia y continúa. El dispositivo debe poder resolver y alcanzar `public_endpoint`. Consulta Seguridad."},"5004":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-272","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#bloque-hawkbit","content":"Se usa solo cuando `mode: hawkbit`."},"5005":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-273","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#bloque-hawkbit","content":"Clave"},"5006":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-274","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#bloque-hawkbit","content":"Por defecto"},"5007":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-275","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#bloque-hawkbit","content":"Descripción"},"5008":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-276","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#bloque-hawkbit","content":"`hawkbit.base_url`"},"5009":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-277","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#bloque-hawkbit","content":"ninguno (obligatoria)"},"5010":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-278","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#bloque-hawkbit","content":"Raíz de la API de gestión de hawkBit, por ejemplo `http://hawkbit:8080`. El arranque falla si está vacía. Las llamadas caducan a los 30 s; las transferencias de artefactos, a las 6 h."},"5011":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-279","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#bloque-hawkbit","content":"`hawkbit.username`, `hawkbit.password`"},"5012":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-280","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#bloque-hawkbit","content":"ninguno"},"5013":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-281","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#bloque-hawkbit","content":"Credenciales Basic Auth de la API de gestión."},"5014":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-282","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#bloque-hawkbit","content":"`hawkbit.tenant`"},"5015":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-283","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#bloque-hawkbit","content":"`DEFAULT`"},"5016":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-284","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#bloque-hawkbit","content":"Segmento de ruta del tenant DDI."},"5017":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-285","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#bloque-hawkbit","content":"`hawkbit.ddi_url`"},"5018":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-286","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#bloque-hawkbit","content":"`hawkbit.base_url`"},"5019":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-287","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#bloque-hawkbit","content":"Raíz DDI de hawkBit **tal como la alcanzan los dispositivos** (por ejemplo `https://updates.example.com/api/hawkbit-ddi`). Se usa para construir las URLs de descarga que reciben los dispositivos, y su ruta pasa a ser el prefijo de la ruta de descarga DDI que sirve este servicio."},"5020":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-288","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#bloque-hawkbit","content":"`hawkbit.artifact_store`"},"5021":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-289","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#bloque-hawkbit","content":"ninguno"},"5022":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-290","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#bloque-hawkbit","content":"Mismo formato que los bloques de almacenamiento de blobs: `storage` debe apuntar al bucket y al `s3_prefix` del plugin S3 de artefactos de hawkBit, y `presign` activa las descargas firmadas. Sin él, los artefactos se transmiten a través de hawkBit."},"5023":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-291","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#bloque-hawkbit","content":"El bloque `storage` (Postgres) también es obligatorio en modo `hawkbit`."},"5024":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-292","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#variables-de-entorno","content":"Cualquier clave del fichero se puede sobrescribir con una variable de entorno: el nombre es la ruta de la clave en mayúsculas con los puntos sustituidos por guiones bajos. `KMS_ENDPOINT` sobrescribe `kms_endpoint`, `STORAGE_PASSWORD` sobrescribe `storage.password` y `BUILDS_PRESIGN_TTL` sobrescribe `builds.presign.ttl`. La clave debe existir en el fichero (basta con un valor vacío): el cargador solo considera las claves que ha leído de él."},"5025":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-293","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#variables-de-entorno","content":"Variables que lee el código además de estas sobrescrituras:"},"5026":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-294","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#variables-de-entorno","content":"Variable"},"5027":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-295","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#variables-de-entorno","content":"Descripción"},"5028":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-296","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#variables-de-entorno","content":"`OTA_CONFIG_FILE`"},"5029":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-297","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#variables-de-entorno","content":"Ruta del fichero de configuración."},"5030":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-298","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#variables-de-entorno","content":"`POD_NAME`, `POD_NAMESPACE`"},"5031":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-299","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#variables-de-entorno","content":"Identidad y espacio de nombres para la elección de líder de Kubernetes. El chart de Helm las define. Si no están definidas, se usan el nombre de host y el fichero de espacio de nombres de la cuenta de servicio."},"5032":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-300","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#variables-de-entorno","content":"`TMPDIR`"},"5033":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-301","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#variables-de-entorno","content":"Dónde escriben ficheros temporales las subidas y las construcciones (el directorio temporal de Go)."},"5034":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-302","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#variables-de-entorno","content":"`SERVER_PORT`"},"5035":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-303","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#variables-de-entorno","content":"Solo lo usa la comprobación de salud de la imagen Docker para encontrar el puerto. Por defecto `10090`."},"5036":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-304","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#variables-de-entorno","content":"`AWS_*`"},"5037":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-305","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#variables-de-entorno","content":"La cadena de credenciales por defecto de AWS, cuando un bloque S3 o AWS KMS no tiene credencial explícita."},"5038":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-306","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#variables-de-entorno","content":"En Docker Compose, el fichero `.env` lo lee `docker-compose.yml`, no el servicio: `HOST_IP`, `HAWKBIT_ADMIN_PASSWORD`, `HAWKBIT_ARTIFACT_STORAGE` y las variables `HAWKBIT_ARTIFACT_S3_*` y `LOCAL_S3_*`. Consulta `.env.example` en el repositorio."},"5039":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-307","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#variables-de-entorno","content":"Con `app.logs.level: debug`, el servicio escribe en el registro, al arrancar, toda la configuración cargada, incluidos `storage.password`, `encryption.local_key`, las claves de S3 y `hawkbit.password`. En modo `native`, el bloque `storage`, contraseña incluida, también se imprime en la salida estándar en cada arranque, sea cual sea el nivel de registro. Usa `info` o superior donde se almacenen o compartan los registros, y guarda los secretos en un gestor de secretos, no en el fichero (consulta las credenciales `*_file` más arriba)."},"5040":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-308","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#configuraciones-mínimas","content":"El modo `native` necesita la base de datos, los endpoints a los que llama y las rutas de almacenamiento. Parte de `config-docker.yml`:"},"5041":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-309","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#configuraciones-mínimas","content":"El modo `hawkbit` necesita `mode: hawkbit`, `hawkbit.base_url`, las credenciales de la API de gestión y el bloque `storage`. Añade los ajustes de construcción solo si quieres construir. Las claves siguientes son las que usa `config-hawkbit.yml`:"},"5042":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-310","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#configuraciones-mínimas","content":"En modo `hawkbit`, las rutas de SymKMS se registran solo cuando `symkms.storage.type` o `sym_keys_dir` están definidos. Con `symkms_endpoint` definido pero ninguno de los dos, el propio servicio respondería `404` a cada consulta de clave."},"5043":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-311","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#symkms-como-proceso-independiente","content":"El binario `cmd/symkms` ejecuta SymKMS en solitario. Su configuración solo tiene `app` (como arriba), `symkms` (un bloque de almacenamiento) y `sym_keys_dir`. Su directorio de claves es por defecto `/data/symmetric_keys` cuando no se define ni `symkms.storage.local_dir` ni `sym_keys_dir`. Sirve `/symkms/v1/*` pero no tiene ruta `/health`, y carece de autenticación igual que el monolito: consulta Seguridad."},"5044":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-312","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#páginas-relacionadas","content":"Operaciones para los valores de Helm, el escalado y las copias de seguridad."},"5045":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-313","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#páginas-relacionadas","content":"Modo hawkBit para lo que cambia en ese backend."},"5046":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-314","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#páginas-relacionadas","content":"Firma y cifrado para las claves que hay detrás de `kms_endpoint` y `symkms`."},"5047":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-315","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#páginas-relacionadas","content":"Resolución de problemas para los errores de arranque."},"5048":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","type":"page","content":"Seguridad","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Actualizaciones","Operación"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security"},"5049":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","content":"Qué protege y qué no protege Lamassu Updates, y qué poner a su alrededor antes de exponerlo."},"5050":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#resumen","content":"Resumen"},"5051":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#qué-poner-delante","content":"Qué poner delante"},"5052":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#cómo-se-identifica-el-servicio-ante-otros","content":"Cómo se identifica el servicio ante otros"},"5053":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#rutas-a-restringir","content":"Rutas a restringir"},"5054":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#qué-comprueba-el-servicio","content":"Qué comprueba el servicio"},"5055":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#urls-de-descarga-prefirmadas","content":"URLs de descarga prefirmadas"},"5056":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#conexiones-salientes","content":"Conexiones salientes"},"5057":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#secretos","content":"Secretos"},"5058":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#modo-hawkbit","content":"Modo hawkBit"},"5059":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#límites-de-petición","content":"Límites de petición"},"5060":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","content":"Lamassu Updates delega la autenticación, la autorización y TLS en el gateway de la plataforma que tiene delante. Esta página lista lo que el servicio aplica por sí mismo, lo que no, y qué configurar a su alrededor. Léela antes de exponer el servicio más allá de una red de confianza."},"5061":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#resumen","content":"Área"},"5062":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#resumen","content":"Estado"},"5063":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#resumen","content":"Autenticación de quien llama a la API"},"5064":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#resumen","content":"**Ninguna en el servicio.** Todas las rutas están abiertas a cualquiera que alcance el puerto. El gateway debe autenticar."},"5065":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#resumen","content":"Autorización"},"5066":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#resumen","content":"**Sin roles ni permisos por grupo.** El servicio solo hace comprobaciones estructurales (consulta Qué comprueba el servicio). El gateway debe autorizar."},"5067":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#resumen","content":"TLS y mTLS (entrada)"},"5068":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#resumen","content":"**No implementado.** El servicio sirve siempre HTTP sin cifrar."},"5069":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#resumen","content":"TLS hacia otros sistemas"},"5070":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#resumen","content":"Postgres: siempre `sslmode=disable`. KMS: no se verifica en modo `native`, y el script firmante de SWU usa `curl -k`. Consulta Conexiones salientes."},"5071":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#resumen","content":"CORS"},"5072":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#resumen","content":"Se permite cualquier origen y cualquier cabecera."},"5073":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#resumen","content":"Limitación de tasa, cabeceras de seguridad"},"5074":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#resumen","content":"El servicio no añade ninguna."},"5075":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#resumen","content":"Firma de paquetes"},"5076":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#resumen","content":"Disponible, mediante el KMS de Lamassu. Consulta Firma y cifrado."},"5077":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#resumen","content":"Cifrado de paquetes"},"5078":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#resumen","content":"Disponible: clave compartida o clave por dispositivo."},"5079":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#resumen","content":"Cifrado en reposo"},"5080":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#resumen","content":"Disponible para artefactos, compilaciones y claves, mediante el bloque `encryption` de cada bloque de almacenamiento."},"5081":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#resumen","content":"Las claves `cert_file`, `key_file` y `authentication.mutual_tls.*` existen en las estructuras de configuración pero no se leen, así que definirlas no tiene efecto."},"5082":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#qué-poner-delante","content":"Ejecuta el servicio detrás de un gateway o proxy inverso que:"},"5083":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#qué-poner-delante","content":"**Termine TLS** entre los clientes y el servicio."},"5084":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#qué-poner-delante","content":"**Autentique y autorice** a quien llama: operadores para la API y dispositivos para las rutas de descarga. Un dispositivo solo debe alcanzar sus propias rutas de descarga, así que haz coincidir el certificado del dispositivo con el `:deviceID` (o `:controllerId`) de la ruta."},"5085":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#qué-poner-delante","content":"**Restrinja las rutas peligrosas** a quienes las necesitan (consulta más abajo)."},"5086":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#qué-poner-delante","content":"Mantén el servicio en una red privada. Los dispositivos solo necesitan alcanzar las rutas de descarga y, en modo `native`, el listener de **cliente** de WFX. En modo `hawkbit` hablan con hawkBit (y con el almacén de URLs firmadas) y no con este servicio, salvo por la ruta de descarga de artefactos descrita en Modo hawkBit."},"5087":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#qué-poner-delante","content":"WFX tiene un listener de cliente (`8080` en Compose, publicado como `9080`) y un listener de gestión (`8081`, publicado como `9081`). Lamassu Updates no autentica ninguno de los dos. Los dispositivos solo necesitan el listener de cliente: no expongas el puerto de gestión a los dispositivos ni a redes no confiables."},"5088":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#cómo-se-identifica-el-servicio-ante-otros","content":"El servicio no reenvía la identidad de quien llama. Las llamadas al Device Manager y al KMS de Lamassu llevan la cabecera fija `X-Principal-ID: admin-mode`, que la capa de autorización de la plataforma acepta para llamadores internos y que el gateway de la plataforma elimina del tráfico externo. El valor no es configurable, así que apunta `dms_endpoint` y `kms_endpoint` a direcciones internas de servicio, no a una ruta pública de gateway que la rechazaría o la reenviaría. Las llamadas del servicio a SymKMS no llevan credencial."},"5089":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-40","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#rutas-a-restringir","content":"Ruta"},"5090":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-41","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#rutas-a-restringir","content":"Por qué"},"5091":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-42","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#rutas-a-restringir","content":"`GET /symkms/v1/:keyID/raw`"},"5092":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-43","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#rutas-a-restringir","content":"Devuelve material de clave sin protección."},"5093":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-44","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#rutas-a-restringir","content":"`GET /symkms/v1/inventory/:deviceID/key`"},"5094":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-45","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#rutas-a-restringir","content":"Devuelve el material de clave sin protección de un dispositivo. El servicio Updates lo usa durante una construcción por dispositivo."},"5095":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-46","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#rutas-a-restringir","content":"`POST /symkms/v1/`, `DELETE /symkms/v1/:keyID`, rutas de asignación de claves"},"5096":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-47","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#rutas-a-restringir","content":"Crean, borran y asignan claves de cifrado."},"5097":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-48","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#rutas-a-restringir","content":"`POST /symkms/v1/encrypt`, `/decrypt`, `/mac`"},"5098":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-49","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#rutas-a-restringir","content":"Usan las claves guardadas sobre datos arbitrarios."},"5099":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-50","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#rutas-a-restringir","content":"`PUT /updates/v1/jobs/:jobID/transition`"},"5100":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-51","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#rutas-a-restringir","content":"Falsifica un cambio de estado de un trabajo sin comprobar propiedad. Se registra solo cuando `enable_test_endpoints` es `true`: mantenlo en `false`."},"5101":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-52","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#rutas-a-restringir","content":"Todo `POST`, `PUT` y `DELETE` de `/updates/v1`"},"5102":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-53","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#rutas-a-restringir","content":"Construir, lanzar, cancelar y borrar. Restríngelos a los operadores."},"5103":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-54","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#rutas-a-restringir","content":"`GET` de artefactos, descriptores y `artifacts-archive`"},"5104":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-55","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#rutas-a-restringir","content":"Exponen fuentes de firmware y sw-descriptions."},"5105":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-56","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#rutas-a-restringir","content":"Rutas de descarga con `:deviceID`"},"5106":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-57","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#rutas-a-restringir","content":"Las construcciones por dispositivo se cifran con la clave de ese dispositivo, pero la propia ruta no comprueba quién la pide."},"5107":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-58","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#qué-comprueba-el-servicio","content":"Son defensa en profundidad, no un sustituto del gateway:"},"5108":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-59","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#qué-comprueba-el-servicio","content":"Un lanzamiento se direcciona bajo su grupo: una operación sobre un lanzamiento a través de la ruta de otro grupo responde `404`, exactamente igual que para un lanzamiento inexistente, y no cambia nada."},"5109":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-60","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#qué-comprueba-el-servicio","content":"Los umbrales de aprobación y de error deben estar entre 0 y 100."},"5110":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-61","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#qué-comprueba-el-servicio","content":"En modo `native`, los identificadores de paquete, grupo y dispositivo usados en las rutas se validan para que no puedan salir de los directorios de almacenamiento, y un paquete por dispositivo nunca recurre a la construcción compartida para un dispositivo."},"5111":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-62","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#qué-comprueba-el-servicio","content":"Una subida con nombre `.swu` debe ser realmente un SWU: cualquier otro contenido se rechaza con `400`."},"5112":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-63","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#qué-comprueba-el-servicio","content":"Un fichero subido mayor que `max_artifact_size_mb` se rechaza con `413`."},"5113":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-64","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#qué-comprueba-el-servicio","content":"En modo `hawkbit`, la ruta DDI de artefactos sirve un fichero solo si el módulo está asignado o instalado en ese dispositivo."},"5114":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-65","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#qué-comprueba-el-servicio","content":"Todo lo que modifica una versión construida se rechaza (`409`): las versiones son inmutables."},"5115":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-66","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#urls-de-descarga-prefirmadas","content":"Con `presign.enabled`, una descarga se responde con `302` a una URL de corta duración del almacén S3. El servicio autoriza antes a quien llama (el gateway para la ruta estática y, en modo `hawkbit`, la asignación del dispositivo); el almacén solo comprueba después la firma, así que **la URL es una capacidad al portador**: quien la posee puede obtener ese único objeto hasta que caduca. El diseño hace aceptable esto:"},"5116":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-67","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#urls-de-descarga-prefirmadas","content":"El TTL es corto (por defecto 60 s). Acota cuándo puede **empezar** un GET: una transferencia en curso termina después de caducar, y un dispositivo que reintenta o reanuda vuelve al endpoint estático para obtener una URL nueva. Una URL ya firmada para el mismo objeto se reutiliza mientras le quede `min_remaining` de validez (por defecto `min(25s, ttl/2)`); no concede más que una nueva."},"5117":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-68","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#urls-de-descarga-prefirmadas","content":"La credencial de firma debe ser **de solo lectura** y distinta de la credencial del almacenamiento. Al arrancar, el servicio hace una prueba de escritura y se niega a ejecutarse si la credencial puede escribir, es la del propio almacenamiento o el almacén la rechaza. Una firma cubre el método y la clave, así que una URL no puede convertirse en un `PUT` ni apuntarse a otro objeto."},"5118":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-69","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#urls-de-descarga-prefirmadas","content":"El host firmado es el origen **público** del almacén (`presign.public_endpoint`), porque la firma cubre la cabecera `Host`."},"5119":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-70","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#urls-de-descarga-prefirmadas","content":"No se puede combinar con el cifrado en reposo del mismo almacén (los dispositivos recibirían texto cifrado)."},"5120":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-71","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#urls-de-descarga-prefirmadas","content":"Las respuestas de redirección llevan `Cache-Control: no-store`. Las peticiones `HEAD` las responde el servicio, no se redirigen. Si falla la firma, el servicio transmite el fichero en lugar de hacer fallar la actualización."},"5121":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-72","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#urls-de-descarga-prefirmadas","content":"Rota la credencial de firma actualizando los ficheros indicados por `access_key_id_file` y `secret_access_key_file`: se releen cada minuto."},"5122":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-73","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#urls-de-descarga-prefirmadas","content":"El propio almacén debe ser alcanzable por los dispositivos en el endpoint público, y debería aceptar solo la credencial de solo lectura sobre el prefijo que sirve. No publiques la consola del almacén ni su API S3 con credenciales por defecto."},"5123":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-74","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#conexiones-salientes","content":"Conexión"},"5124":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-75","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#conexiones-salientes","content":"Seguridad del transporte"},"5125":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-76","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#conexiones-salientes","content":"Postgres"},"5126":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-77","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#conexiones-salientes","content":"`sslmode=disable`, no configurable. Mantén la base de datos en una red privada."},"5127":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-78","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#conexiones-salientes","content":"Device Manager de Lamassu"},"5128":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-79","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#conexiones-salientes","content":"El cliente del SDK de la plataforma Lamassu con sus ajustes por defecto."},"5129":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-80","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#conexiones-salientes","content":"KMS de Lamassu"},"5130":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-81","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#conexiones-salientes","content":"Modo `native`: la verificación del certificado se **omite** en las llamadas propias del servicio, y el script firmante de SWU usa `curl -k`. Modo `hawkbit`: las llamadas del servicio verifican el certificado, el script sigue sin hacerlo. Usa una dirección interna de confianza."},"5131":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-82","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#conexiones-salientes","content":"SymKMS"},"5132":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-83","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#conexiones-salientes","content":"El esquema de `symkms_endpoint` (normalmente el propio servicio, por HTTP sin cifrar en los ejemplos), sin credencial. El material de clave sin protección cruza esta conexión: mantenla en `localhost` o en una red privada."},"5133":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-84","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#conexiones-salientes","content":"API de gestión de hawkBit"},"5134":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-85","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#conexiones-salientes","content":"HTTP Basic con `hawkbit.username` y `hawkbit.password`. Usa HTTPS."},"5135":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-86","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#conexiones-salientes","content":"WFX"},"5136":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-87","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#conexiones-salientes","content":"El esquema de `wfx_endpoint` (HTTP sin cifrar en los ejemplos), hacia el listener de gestión."},"5137":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-88","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#secretos","content":"`encryption.local_key`, las credenciales de S3 y las contraseñas de base de datos deben venir de un gestor de secretos, no de un fichero del repositorio. Las configuraciones de ejemplo contienen solo valores de desarrollo. Prefiere la forma `*_file` de las credenciales de S3 y de presign, que el servicio relee cada minuto."},"5138":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-89","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#secretos","content":"El chart de Helm vuelca todo `config` en un ConfigMap. Consulta Operaciones. Sustituye su contraseña de base de datos de ejemplo."},"5139":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-90","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#secretos","content":"Con `app.logs.level: debug` el servicio registra toda la configuración, secretos incluidos, y en modo `native` imprime el bloque `storage` (con su contraseña) en la salida estándar en cada arranque. Usa `info` o superior en cualquier entorno cuyos registros se almacenen."},"5140":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-91","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#secretos","content":"Perder `encryption.local_key` deja ilegible todo lo guardado con ella. Consulta Copias de seguridad y restauración."},"5141":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-92","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#secretos","content":"Las claves de firma permanecen en el KMS de Lamassu: el servicio nunca tiene la clave privada. Las claves de cifrado de dispositivo sí viven en SymKMS (opcionalmente cifradas en reposo), porque los paquetes deben cifrarse con ellas."},"5142":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-93","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#secretos","content":"La imagen de contenedor no reduce privilegios. Define un `securityContext` adecuado para tu clúster."},"5143":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-94","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#modo-hawkbit","content":"El usuario de la API de gestión es administrador completo de hawkBit. Cambia la credencial por defecto (`admin`), mantén la API fuera de la red de dispositivos y sírvela por HTTPS."},"5144":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-95","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#modo-hawkbit","content":"Los dispositivos se autentican ante hawkBit, no ante este servicio. hawkBit 1.1.0 no tiene modo anónimo: habilita un token de seguridad de target, un token de gateway o el autenticador por cabecera de proxy inverso, y para este último restringe qué direcciones pueden fijar sus cabeceras. Dejar desactivada la autenticación de dispositivos, aceptable solo en una pila de pruebas desechable, permite que cualquiera que alcance hawkBit suplante a un dispositivo. Consulta Modo hawkBit."},"5145":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-96","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#modo-hawkbit","content":"hawkBit no cifra los artefactos en reposo. Activa el cifrado por defecto en el bucket, o usa paquetes cifrados (clave compartida)."},"5146":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-97","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#límites-de-petición","content":"Un cuerpo de petición puede llegar a `max_artifact_size_mb` más 1 MiB (10 GiB por defecto), y una petición puede durar hasta 6 horas, así que las subidas grandes funcionan. Las subidas en streaming usan disco temporal bajo `TMPDIR`. Aplica límites más estrictos en el gateway para quienes no sean de confianza: el servicio no limita la tasa de peticiones."},"5147":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","type":"page","content":"Firma y cifrado","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Actualizaciones","Conceptos"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption"},"5148":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","content":"Firma los entregables con el KMS de Lamassu, cífralos con una clave compartida o por dispositivo y gestiona las claves de dispositivo en SymKMS."},"5149":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#firma","content":"Firma"},"5150":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#configura-la-firma","content":"Configura la firma"},"5151":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#crea-la-clave-y-un-certificado","content":"Crea la clave y un certificado"},"5152":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#configura-el-servicio","content":"Configura el servicio"},"5153":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#envía-los-campos-de-firma-en-la-construcción","content":"Envía los campos de firma en la construcción"},"5154":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#manifiestos-firmados","content":"Manifiestos firmados"},"5155":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#modos-de-cifrado","content":"Modos de cifrado"},"5156":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#algoritmos","content":"Algoritmos"},"5157":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#configurar-el-cifrado-por-dispositivo","content":"Configurar el cifrado por dispositivo"},"5158":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#crea-una-clave-por-dispositivo","content":"Crea una clave por dispositivo"},"5159":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#asígnala-al-dispositivo","content":"Asígnala al dispositivo"},"5160":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#pon-la-misma-clave-en-el-dispositivo","content":"Pon la misma clave en el dispositivo"},"5161":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#construye","content":"Construye"},"5162":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#symkms","content":"SymKMS"},"5163":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#cuerpos-de-petición","content":"Cuerpos de petición"},"5164":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","content":"Esta página explica cómo protege Lamassu Updates lo que entrega: qué claves firman y cifran un paquete, cómo configurarlas y qué soporta cada backend. Hay tres capas independientes."},"5165":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","content":"Capa"},"5166":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","content":"Protege"},"5167":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","content":"Se configura en"},"5168":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","content":"Firma del paquete"},"5169":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","content":"Que el paquete viene de ti y no se ha modificado"},"5170":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","content":"Una clave de firma y un certificado en el KMS de Lamassu, más `kms_endpoint` y `sign_script_path`"},"5171":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","content":"Cifrado del paquete"},"5172":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","content":"El contenido del paquete en tránsito y en la ruta de descarga del dispositivo"},"5173":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","content":"La petición de construcción, más una clave en SymKMS"},"5174":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","content":"Cifrado en reposo"},"5175":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","content":"Artefactos, compilaciones y claves que almacena el servicio"},"5176":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","content":"El bloque `encryption` de cada bloque de almacenamiento de blobs"},"5177":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#firma","content":"La firma es opcional. Cuando la pides, `swugenerator` llama al script firmante configurado (`sign_script_path`, que es `sign_kms.sh`) y el script pide al KMS de Lamassu (`kms_endpoint`) que firme. La clave privada nunca llega a la máquina que construye el paquete."},"5178":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#firma","content":"Para las construcciones de `.swu` deben estar definidos ambos ajustes: el servicio rechaza una petición de firma cuando falta alguno."},"5179":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#firma","content":"Firmar un manifiesto, un paquete `non-swu` o un módulo `raw` de hawkBit llama al KMS directamente desde el servicio y solo necesita `kms_endpoint`."},"5180":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#firma","content":"Selecciona la clave en la petición de construcción con `signature_key_id`, `signature_alg_name` (por defecto `RSASSA_PSS_SHA_256`; `-` y `_` son intercambiables) y `signature_certificate` (PEM). Los tres campos van juntos: una petición con clave pero sin algoritmo o certificado se rechaza, nunca se construye sin firmar."},"5181":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#crea-la-clave-y-un-certificado","content":"En el KMS de Lamassu, crea (o elige) la clave de firma y emite un certificado para ella desde una CA en la que confíen tus dispositivos. Consulta Claves y motores criptográficos. El ID de la clave es tu `signature_key_id`."},"5182":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#configura-el-servicio","content":"Define `kms_endpoint` y `sign_script_path` (`/app/sign_kms.sh` en la imagen). `swugenerator` llama al script con el ID de la clave, la URL del KMS, el algoritmo y la ruta del fichero del certificado, que el script exige. El script escribe un registro de depuración en `/tmp/sign_kms_debug.log`."},"5183":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#envía-los-campos-de-firma-en-la-construcción","content":"Incluye `signature_key_id`, `signature_alg_name` y `signature_certificate` en el cuerpo de la construcción. En modo `hawkbit` van en el cuerpo de la construcción del módulo."},"5184":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#envía-los-campos-de-firma-en-la-construcción","content":"SWUpdate verifica un `.swu` con una firma CMS `SignedData`, y el servicio exige CMS para los manifiestos que firma él mismo. Un KMS de Lamassu que ignora la cabecera `Accept` y responde con una firma simple dentro de un sobre JSON produce una firma que ningún dispositivo puede verificar. Cuando firma el propio servicio (manifiestos de versión, manifiestos de conjunto, sumas de verificación de módulos raw) rechaza esa respuesta y la operación falla con `the KMS did not return a PKCS7/CMS signature`. El script firmante de SWU no comprueba el formato: desempaqueta la respuesta y la incrusta, así que con un KMS sin soporte CMS una construcción de `.swu` puede salir bien y aun así ser rechazada por un dispositivo que define `public-key-file`. Prueba una construcción firmada en un dispositivo real antes de fiarte de una versión del KMS."},"5185":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#envía-los-campos-de-firma-en-la-construcción","content":"`sign_kms_nocms.sh` es una variante del script que no recibe certificado. La firma de manifiestos del propio servicio es independiente: envía siempre el certificado y se niega a firmar sin él."},"5186":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#envía-los-campos-de-firma-en-la-construcción","content":"TLS hacia el KMS: en modo `native` el cliente KMS del servicio omite la verificación del certificado, y `sign_kms.sh` llama a `curl -k`. En modo `hawkbit` las llamadas del propio servicio al KMS verifican el certificado, pero el script firmante de SWU sigue usando `curl -k`. Alcanza el KMS por una dirección interna de confianza. Consulta Seguridad."},"5187":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#manifiestos-firmados","content":"Cada versión construida tiene además un **manifiesto**, un registro antirretroceso de lo que contiene la versión: nombre, grupo, versión, empaquetado, artefactos con su SHA-256, el entregable y, en modo `hawkbit`, los módulos y versiones exactos que componen el conjunto. Un manifiesto es válido durante 5 años (`expires_at`). Se firma con la clave del KMS cuando la construcción llevaba campos de firma, y se guarda sin firmar en caso contrario (el servicio registra una advertencia). Si hay una clave de firma configurada pero el manifiesto no se puede firmar, la construcción falla."},"5188":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-40","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#manifiestos-firmados","content":"Léelo con:"},"5189":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-41","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#manifiestos-firmados","content":"La respuesta contiene `manifest` (los bytes exactos que cubre la firma), `signature` (CMS en base64), `algorithm`, `certificate` (PEM), `signed_at` y `expires_at`. En modo `hawkbit`, `stale: true` significa que existe un manifiesto firmado pero el contenido del conjunto ha cambiado desde entonces, así que el manifiesto devuelto describe el conjunto tal como está ahora. La capacidad `artifact_signatures` indica si el backend activo lo ofrece."},"5190":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-42","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#modos-de-cifrado","content":"Modo"},"5191":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-43","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#modos-de-cifrado","content":"Qué obtienes"},"5192":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-44","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#modos-de-cifrado","content":"`native`"},"5193":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-45","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#modos-de-cifrado","content":"`hawkbit`"},"5194":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-46","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#modos-de-cifrado","content":"Ninguno"},"5195":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-47","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#modos-de-cifrado","content":"Un entregable sin cifrar"},"5196":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-48","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#modos-de-cifrado","content":"Sí"},"5197":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-49","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#modos-de-cifrado","content":"Sí"},"5198":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-50","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#modos-de-cifrado","content":"Compartido"},"5199":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-51","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#modos-de-cifrado","content":"Un entregable cifrado con una clave, servido a todos los dispositivos"},"5200":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-52","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#modos-de-cifrado","content":"Sí"},"5201":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-53","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#modos-de-cifrado","content":"Sí, mediante los endpoints de construcción de módulos, cuando el pipeline de construcción está configurado"},"5202":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-54","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#modos-de-cifrado","content":"Por dispositivo"},"5203":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-55","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#modos-de-cifrado","content":"Un entregable por dispositivo, cada uno cifrado con la clave propia de ese dispositivo en SymKMS"},"5204":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-56","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#modos-de-cifrado","content":"Sí"},"5205":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-57","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#modos-de-cifrado","content":"No"},"5206":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-58","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#modos-de-cifrado","content":"El cuerpo de la construcción decide el modo:"},"5207":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-59","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#modos-de-cifrado","content":"**Compartido**: envía `user`, `encryption_key_name` y `encryption_alg_name`. Una construcción de `.swu` se rechaza sin el algoritmo. Una construcción `.../package` elige AES-GCM según la longitud de la clave y solo registra el nombre que envíes."},"5208":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-60","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#modos-de-cifrado","content":"**Por dispositivo**: envía `encryption_alg_name` **sin** `user` ni `encryption_key_name`. Esto vale también para `.../package`: enviar el algoritmo es lo que selecciona el modo por dispositivo, y omitirlo construye un paquete sin cifrar."},"5209":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-61","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#modos-de-cifrado","content":"**Ninguno**: no envíes ninguno de los dos."},"5210":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-62","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#modos-de-cifrado","content":"Otros campos de la construcción: `sw_desc_encrypted` cifra también la propia sw-description, y `selected_artifact_ids` lista los artefactos que incluye la construcción. En modo `native`, una construcción de `.swu` sin artefactos seleccionados falla."},"5211":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-63","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#modos-de-cifrado","content":"En modo `hawkbit`, `POST .../swu` devuelve `501`. Envía en su lugar los mismos campos de firma y cifrado a la construcción del módulo: `POST /updates/v1/softwaremodules/by-id/:moduleID/build` (para módulos `swu-build` y `raw`). Consulta Modo hawkBit."},"5212":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-64","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#modos-de-cifrado","content":"La sw-description debe marcar los artefactos a cifrar con `encrypted = true;`. Una construcción por dispositivo se rechaza cuando no hay ningún artefacto marcado, porque la clave por sí sola no hace nada."},"5213":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-65","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#algoritmos","content":"El `algorithm` de una clave de SymKMS y el `encryption_alg_name` de una construcción usan estos nombres."},"5214":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-66","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#algoritmos","content":"Algoritmo"},"5215":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-67","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#algoritmos","content":"Longitud de clave"},"5216":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-68","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#algoritmos","content":"`AES-128-CBC`, `AES-128-CTR`, `AES-128-GCM`"},"5217":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-69","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#algoritmos","content":"16 bytes"},"5218":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-70","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#algoritmos","content":"`AES-192-CBC`, `AES-192-CTR`, `AES-192-GCM`"},"5219":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-71","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#algoritmos","content":"24 bytes"},"5220":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-72","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#algoritmos","content":"`AES-256-CBC`, `AES-256-CTR`, `AES-256-GCM`"},"5221":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-73","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#algoritmos","content":"32 bytes"},"5222":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-74","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#algoritmos","content":"`ASCON-128`, `ASCON-128A`"},"5223":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-75","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#algoritmos","content":"16 bytes"},"5224":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-76","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#algoritmos","content":"`ASCON-80PQ`"},"5225":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-77","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#algoritmos","content":"20 bytes"},"5226":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-78","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#algoritmos","content":"**Nombres de clave en SymKMS**: la comparación ignora mayúsculas y minúsculas, y `_` y `-` son intercambiables (`aes_256_gcm` se guarda como `AES-256-GCM`). Los separadores del nombre deben seguir estando: `ascon128a` no es `ASCON-128A`. Una clave cuya longitud no coincide con su algoritmo se rechaza al crearla."},"5227":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-79","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#algoritmos","content":"**Nombres en construcciones**: `encryption_alg_name` se pasa tal cual a `swugenerator`. Se ignoran las mayúsculas, pero los guiones son obligatorios: `aes-256-gcm` funciona, `AES_256_GCM` se rechaza. Si el nombre difiere del algoritmo guardado con la clave, el servicio registra una advertencia y usa el nombre de la petición."},"5228":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-80","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#algoritmos","content":"**Los paquetes `non-swu`** (`.../package`, y los módulos `raw` de `hawkbit`) se cifran siempre con **AES-GCM**, elegido por la longitud de la clave (16, 24 o 32 bytes). El nombre solicitado solo se registra, y una clave Ascon-80pq de 20 bytes se rechaza. El resultado es `nonce || ciphertext`."},"5229":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-81","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#algoritmos","content":"El servicio genera el IV o nonce. En modo `native`, el algoritmo y, en los paquetes con clave compartida, el IV se pasan al dispositivo en el trabajo de WFX. Una construcción por dispositivo genera un IV nuevo para cada dispositivo y no lo registra en el trabajo, así que el trabajo lleva solo el algoritmo. Los campos del trabajo se listan en Conectar un dispositivo."},"5230":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-82","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#crea-una-clave-por-dispositivo","content":"En SymKMS, `POST /symkms/v1/` con `user_id`, un `algorithm` de la tabla y una `key` (hex o base64) de la longitud correcta."},"5231":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-83","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#asígnala-al-dispositivo","content":"`POST /symkms/v1/inventory/:deviceID/keys/:keyID` con un cuerpo `{\"purpose\":\"firmware-encryption\"}` y un `expires_at` opcional (RFC 3339). Una construcción por dispositivo pide la clave `firmware-encryption` de cada dispositivo."},"5232":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-84","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#pon-la-misma-clave-en-el-dispositivo","content":"En la forma que espera SWUpdate (su fichero de claves `-K`, con la clave, el IV y el algoritmo)."},"5233":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-85","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#construye","content":"Envía `encryption_alg_name` y no envíes `user` ni `encryption_key_name`. La sw-description debe marcar un artefacto con `encrypted = true;`."},"5234":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-86","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#construye","content":"**Propósitos de clave.** Los propósitos convencionales son `firmware-encryption`, `config-encryption` y `mac-verification`. El propósito es un marcador de posición: se acepta cualquier valor, y una asignación con propósito vacío actúa como comodín que coincide con cualquier búsqueda. Es intencionado mientras se despliegan las claves por propósito. Una coincidencia exacta (sin distinguir mayúsculas) gana al comodín, y entre iguales gana la asignación más reciente. Las asignaciones caducadas o revocadas se omiten."},"5235":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-87","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#construye","content":"**Cobertura.** Un dispositivo sin clave `firmware-encryption` se omite (el motivo dice `no firmware-encryption key assigned` en las construcciones de `.swu`). La construcción sigue teniendo éxito si se cubrió al menos un dispositivo, y el paquete registra la cobertura: lee `built_device_count`, `total_device_count` y `uncovered_devices` en él. Un lanzamiento sobre un paquete con dispositivos sin cubrir se rechaza con `400`, y no hay forma de forzarlo: asigna las claves que faltan y construye de nuevo. Si no se cubrió ningún dispositivo, falla la propia construcción."},"5236":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-88","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#construye","content":"**Coste.** Una construcción por dispositivo ejecuta un proceso `swugenerator` por dispositivo, en paralelo hasta la CPU disponible para el contenedor. Con un artefacto de 100 MB, un dispositivo cuesta aproximadamente medio segundo de cifrado, más unos tres segundos adicionales si la sw-description pide compresión gzip. Dimensiona el contenedor en consecuencia: consulta Dimensionado de recursos. Las construcciones del mismo paquete se serializan: una segunda construcción o un cambio de versión mientras otra se ejecuta responde `409`."},"5237":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-89","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#symkms","content":"SymKMS es el servicio de claves simétricas integrado, servido por el mismo proceso bajo `/symkms/v1`. Almacena claves, las asigna a dispositivos y también puede cifrar, descifrar y calcular MAC. Las claves se guardan en el almacén de blobs `symkms`, opcionalmente con cifrado en reposo. Crea las claves con la longitud correcta para su algoritmo: bytes aleatorios, nunca una frase de contraseña."},"5238":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-90","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#symkms","content":"Tarea"},"5239":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-91","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#symkms","content":"Ruta"},"5240":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-92","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#symkms","content":"Guardar una clave"},"5241":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-93","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#symkms","content":"`POST /symkms/v1/`"},"5242":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-94","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#symkms","content":"Listar las claves de un usuario"},"5243":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-95","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#symkms","content":"`GET /symkms/v1/?user_id=...`"},"5244":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-96","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#symkms","content":"Borrar una clave"},"5245":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-97","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#symkms","content":"`DELETE /symkms/v1/:keyID?user_id=...`"},"5246":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-98","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#symkms","content":"Asignar o revocar una clave a un dispositivo"},"5247":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-99","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#symkms","content":"`POST` o `DELETE /symkms/v1/inventory/:deviceID/keys/:keyID`"},"5248":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-100","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#symkms","content":"La clave activa de un dispositivo (privilegiada, devuelve material de clave)"},"5249":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-101","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#symkms","content":"`GET /symkms/v1/inventory/:deviceID/key?purpose=...`"},"5250":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-102","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#symkms","content":"Qué dispositivos usan una clave"},"5251":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-103","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#symkms","content":"`GET /symkms/v1/inventory/by-key/:keyID`"},"5252":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-104","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#symkms","content":"Las asignaciones de clave de un dispositivo"},"5253":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-105","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#symkms","content":"`GET /symkms/v1/inventory/:deviceID`"},"5254":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-106","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#symkms","content":"Cifrar, descifrar"},"5255":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-107","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#symkms","content":"`POST /symkms/v1/encrypt`, `POST /symkms/v1/decrypt`"},"5256":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-108","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#symkms","content":"Calcular y verificar MAC"},"5257":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-109","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#symkms","content":"`POST /symkms/v1/mac`, `POST /symkms/v1/mac/verify` (y las variantes `/file`)"},"5258":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-110","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#cuerpos-de-petición","content":"Ruta"},"5259":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-111","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#cuerpos-de-petición","content":"Cuerpo (JSON)"},"5260":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-112","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#cuerpos-de-petición","content":"`POST /symkms/v1/`"},"5261":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-113","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#cuerpos-de-petición","content":"`user_id`, `algorithm`, `key` (hex o base64; se prueba hex primero), `id` opcional. `user_id`, `algorithm` y `key` son obligatorios."},"5262":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-114","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#cuerpos-de-petición","content":"`POST /symkms/v1/encrypt`"},"5263":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-115","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#cuerpos-de-petición","content":"`user_id`, `key_name`, `algorithm`, `plaintext` (base64), `iv` opcional, `format` opcional."},"5264":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-116","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#cuerpos-de-petición","content":"`POST /symkms/v1/decrypt`"},"5265":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-117","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#cuerpos-de-petición","content":"`user_id`, `key_name`, `algorithm`, `ciphertext`, `iv`, `format` opcional."},"5266":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-118","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#cuerpos-de-petición","content":"`POST /symkms/v1/mac`"},"5267":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-119","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#cuerpos-de-petición","content":"`user_id`, `key_name`, `mac_algorithm`, `data` (base64). El MAC se devuelve en hex."},"5268":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-120","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#cuerpos-de-petición","content":"`POST /symkms/v1/mac/verify`"},"5269":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-121","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#cuerpos-de-petición","content":"Igual que `/mac`, más `mac` (hex)."},"5270":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-122","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#cuerpos-de-petición","content":"`format` es `ciphertext` (hex, el valor por defecto), `base64` o `cms` (`pkcs7` es un alias): una estructura CMS codificada en PEM que incluye el algoritmo y el IV. Con `cms`, `decrypt` puede omitir `algorithm` e `iv`."},"5271":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-123","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#cuerpos-de-petición","content":"El servidor genera el nonce para GCM, CTR y Ascon: **se rechaza un `iv` aportado por quien llama** para esos algoritmos. Solo CBC acepta uno (16 bytes). La respuesta incluye el `iv` usado (hex)."},"5272":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-124","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#cuerpos-de-petición","content":"`mac_algorithm` es `HMAC-SHA3-256`, `AES-CMAC` o `ASCON-MAC`. Las variantes `/file` reciben los datos como `multipart/form-data`."},"5273":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-125","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#cuerpos-de-petición","content":"`GET /symkms/v1/:keyID/raw?user_id=...` y `GET /symkms/v1/inventory/:deviceID/key` devuelven material de clave sin protección y son privilegiadas: el propio servicio Updates las llama durante una construcción. El servicio no tiene autenticación propia, así que restringe estas rutas en un gateway. Consulta Seguridad."},"5274":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption-126","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/signing-and-encryption#cuerpos-de-petición","content":"Las mismas rutas de SymKMS pueden ejecutarse como proceso propio (`cmd/symkms`) en lugar de dentro del monolito. Consulta Configuración."},"5275":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting","type":"page","content":"Resolución de problemas","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","Actualizaciones","Operación"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting"},"5276":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting","content":"Síntomas, causas probables y soluciones para errores de arranque, llamadas a la API, construcciones, descargas y actualizaciones que no llegan a los dispositivos."},"5277":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting#códigos-de-estado-http","content":"Códigos de estado HTTP"},"5278":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting#arranque-del-servicio","content":"Arranque del servicio"},"5279":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubles