iew/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting-77","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting#llamadas-a-la-api","content":"Síntoma o mensaje"},"5354":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting-78","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting#llamadas-a-la-api","content":"Causa probable"},"5355":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting-79","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting#llamadas-a-la-api","content":"Solución"},"5356":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting-80","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting#llamadas-a-la-api","content":"`501 Not Implemented`"},"5357":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting-81","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting#llamadas-a-la-api","content":"El backend activo no soporta la operación"},"5358":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting-82","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting#llamadas-a-la-api","content":"Lee `GET /updates/v1/capabilities`. En modo `hawkbit`, `POST .../swu` y `.../package` responden siempre `501`: construye los módulos en el catálogo."},"5359":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting-83","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting#llamadas-a-la-api","content":"`409` `update pack version X is already built; create a new version ...`"},"5360":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting-84","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting#llamadas-a-la-api","content":"Has cambiado una versión construida"},"5361":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting-85","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting#llamadas-a-la-api","content":"Modo native: `POST .../new` con `{\"version\":\"x.y.z\"}` mayor que la actual, vuelve a subir la sw-description (no se arrastra) y da una `version` mayor a cualquier artefacto que vuelvas a subir. Modo `hawkbit`: consulta la fila siguiente."},"5362":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting-86","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting#llamadas-a-la-api","content":"`hawkbit mode: cannot ... here — a software module linked to a distribution set is frozen` (`400`)"},"5363":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting-87","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting#llamadas-a-la-api","content":"En modo `hawkbit` se rechazan las ediciones con ámbito de paquete"},"5364":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting-88","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting#llamadas-a-la-api","content":"Desenlaza el módulo, cámbialo y constrúyelo en el catálogo, y enlázalo de nuevo. O publica una versión nueva del módulo y crea un paquete a partir de ella con otro nombre: los nombres de paquete son únicos por grupo, y un módulo `os` no se puede intercambiar en un paquete existente. Consulta Modo hawkBit."},"5365":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting-89","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting#llamadas-a-la-api","content":"`409` `... is being built or changed by another request; retry when it finishes`"},"5366":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting-90","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting#llamadas-a-la-api","content":"Dos construcciones, o una construcción y un cambio, sobre el mismo paquete o módulo"},"5367":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting-91","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting#llamadas-a-la-api","content":"Espera y reintenta. El bloqueo se libera cuando la operación termina o falla."},"5368":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting-92","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting#llamadas-a-la-api","content":"`409` al crear"},"5369":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting-93","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/troubleshooting#llamadas-a-la-api","content":"Ya existe un paquete con ese nombre en el grupo"},"5370":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updat